helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154549				0	br	As soon as the variable has been declared, it is automatically set to the "Null" value. Note the following conventions:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154567				0	br	21 elements numbered from 0 to 20				2002-02-02 02:02:02
