helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id6519974				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether the nodes of the tree control are editable.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id6591082				0	br	Setting this property to TRUE causes the changes to be automatically saved when editing is interrupted. FALSE means that editing is canceled and changes are lost.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
