helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id7706228				0	br	Adds the scrollbar type that you specify to a text box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id9174779				0	br	If Root displayed is set to FALSE, the root node of a model is no longer a valid node for the tree control and can't be used with any method of XTreeControl.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
