helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	br	Click the name of a variable to select it, then click the \<emph\>Enable Watch\</emph\> icon. The value that is assigned to the variable is displayed next to its name. This value is constantly updated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
