helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	br	\<emph\>x_pos\</emph\>: Integer expression that specifies the horizontal position of the dialog. The position is an absolute coordinate and does not refer to the window of the office application.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	br	Dim sText As String				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	br	End Sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	br	MsgBox ( sText , 64, "Confirmation of phrase")				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	br	The \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> statement is a convenient method of entering text through a dialog. Confirm the input by clicking OK or pressing Return. The input is returned as the function return value. If you close the dialog with Cancel, \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> returns a zero-length string ("").				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	br	Displays a prompt in a dialog at which the user can input text. The input is assigned to a variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311	9			0	br	\<emph\>Msg\</emph\>: String expression displayed as the message in the dialog box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	br	Sub ExampleInputBox				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	br	If \<emph\>x_pos\</emph\> and \<emph\>y_pos\</emph\> are omitted, the dialog is centered on the screen. The position is specified in \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp#twips\" name=\"twips\"\>twips\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307	11			0	br	\<emph\>Default\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the text box as default if no other input is given.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154367				0	br	sText = InputBox ("Please enter a phrase:","Dear User")				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3156024	13			0	br	\<emph\>y_pos\</emph\>: Integer expression that specifies the vertical position of the dialog. The position is an absolute coordinate and does not refer to the window of the office application.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201	5			0	br	InputBox (Msg As String[, Title As String[, Default As String[, x_pos As Integer, y_pos As Integer]]]]) 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
