helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	br	\<emph\>Mode:\</emph\> Keyword that specifies the file mode. Valid values: Append (append to sequential file), binary (data can be accessed by bytes using Get and Put), Input (opens data channel for reading), Output (opens data channel for writing), and Random (edits relative files).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	br	\<emph\>Protected:\</emph\> Keyword that defines the security status of a file after opening. Valid values: Shared (file may be opened by other applications), Lock Read (file is protected against reading), Lock Write (file is protected against writing), Lock Read Write (denies file access).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
