helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020404.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156				0	br	To check if a file exists, enter the complete path and name of the file. If the file or directory name does not exist, the Dir function returns a zero-length string ("").				2002-02-02 02:02:02
