helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	br	The following numeric functions perform calculations. Mathematical and Boolean operators are described in a separate section. Functions differ from operators in that functions pass arguments and return a result, instead of operators that return a result by combining two numeric expressions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
