helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145316	2			0	br	Calls a subroutine that is indicated by a label from a subroutine or a function. The statements following the label are executed until the next Return statement. Afterwards, the program continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>GoSub \</emph\>statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
