helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151251				0	br	\<emph\>String:\</emph\> String variable consisting of a maximum of 64,000 ASCII characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151274				0	br	DIM text(-15 to 5) as String REM 21 elements (including 0)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	br	Dim declares local variables within subroutines. Global variables are declared with the PUBLIC or the PRIVATE statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
