helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155937				0	br	\<emph\>Single:\</emph\> Single-precision floating-point variable (3,402823 x 10E38 - 1,401298 x 10E-45).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156057				0	br	\<emph\>Date:\</emph\> Date variable				2002-02-02 02:02:02
