helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	br	Declares a variable or an array.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729				0	br	\<emph\>[Single]:\</emph\> Single floating-point variable (3.402823x10E38 - 1.401298x10E-45). If no key word is specified, a variable is defined as Single, unless a statement from DefBool to DefVar is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
