helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120302.xhp	0	help	par_id3154347				0	br	See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120310.xhp\" name=\"UCase\"\>UCase\</link\> Function				2002-02-02 02:02:02
