helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	br	Returns the number of leftmost characters that you specify of a string expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	br	String				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	br	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that you want to return the leftmost characters from.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
