helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120308.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	br	The following example uses the \<emph\>RSet\</emph\> and \<emph\>LSet\</emph\> statements to modify the left and right alignment of a string.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
