helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	br	Both LibraryContainers exist in an application level and within every document. In the document Basic, the document's LibraryContainers are called automatically. If you want to call the global LibraryContainers from within a document, you must use the keyword \<emph\>GlobalScope\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
