helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	br	The prefix calls registered Listeners from Basic-subroutines. The Basic run-time system searches for Basic-subroutines or functions that have the name "PrefixListenerMethode" and calls them when found. Otherwise, a run-time error occurs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
