helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	br	The Listener must then be added to the Broadcaster Object. This is done by calling the appropriate method for adding a Listener. These methods always follow the pattern "addFooListener", where "Foo" is the Listener Interface Type, without the 'X'. In this example, the addContainerListener method is called to register the XContainerListener:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
