helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149315				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3155757\" src=\"sc/res/pages.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155757\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150048				0	br	Page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150206				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_FILE\"\>Inserts a file name placeholder in the selected area.\</ahelp\> Click to insert the title. Long-click to select either title, file name or path/file name from the submenu. If a title has not be assigned (see \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>), the file name will be inserted instead.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150369				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3150518\" src=\"res/folderop.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150518\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150540				0	br	Date				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717	10			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_TEXT\"\>Opens a dialog to assign formats to new or selected text.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Text Attributes \</emph\>dialog contains the tab pages \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Font\"\>Font\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020200.xhp\" name=\"Font Effects\"\>Font Effects\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020500.xhp\" name=\"Font Position\"\>Font Position\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_HFED_FL\"\>Defines or formats a header or footer for a Page Style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151304				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3155386\" src=\"sc/res/page.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155386\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153122				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3146884\" src=\"sc/res/time.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146884\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_PAGES\"\>Inserts a placeholder in the selected header/footer area, which is replaced by the total number of pages in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153960				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_DATE\"\>Inserts a placeholder in the selected header/footer area, which is replaced by the current date which will be repeated in the header/footer on each page of the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154487				0	br	File Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154960				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_PAGE\"\>Inserts a placeholder in the selected header/footer area, which is replaced by page numbering. This allows continuous page numbering in a document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155336				0	br	Text Attributes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157904				0	br	Time				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159266				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3156386\" src=\"sc/res/text.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156386\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163710				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_HF_FLC\"\>Enter the text to be displayed at the center of the header or footer\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10811				0	br	Header/Footer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10815				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a predefined header or footer from the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Header/Footer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	bm_id8473769				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>filling;selection lists\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>selection lists;filling cells\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149207				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140500.xhp\" name=\"Sheet\"\>Sheet\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153876				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Fill\"\>Fill\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155111				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140600.xhp\" name=\"Rows\"\>Rows\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	br	Call the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> when positioned in a cell and choose \<emph\>Selection List\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	br	The $[officename] Calc context menus have \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"other options\"\>additional options\</link\> for filling the cells.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	br	Click one of the listed entries to copy it to the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152994				0	br	\<emph\>Filling cells using context menus:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156285				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Automatically fills cells with content.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSelect\"\>A list box containing all text found in the current column is displayed.\</ahelp\> The text is sorted alphabetically and multiple entries are listed only once.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Fill				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140100.xhp\" name=\"Down\"\>Down\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	br	If a selected range has only one column, the contents of the top cell are copied to all others. If several columns are selected, the contents of the corresponding top cell will be copied down.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillDown\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the top cell of the range.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Down				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140200.xhp\" name=\"Right\"\>Right\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillRight\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two columns with the contents of the left most cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	br	If a range of only one row is selected, the contents of the far left cell are copied to all the other selected cells. If you have selected several rows, each of the far left cells is copied into those cells to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140300.xhp\" name=\"Up\"\>Up\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	br	If a selected range has only one column, the content of the bottom most cell is copied into the selected cells. If several columns are selected, the contents of the bottom most cells are copied into those selected above.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillUp\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the bottom most cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Up				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140400.xhp\" name=\"Left\"\>Left\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillLeft\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two columns with the contents of the far right cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	br	If a selected range has only one row, the content of the far right cell is copied into all other cells of the range. If several rows are selected, the far right cells are copied into the cells to the left.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153897				0	br	Fill Sheet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155131				0	br	Filling a Spreadsheet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	br	Select the entire sheet by clicking the empty gray box in the upper left of the spreadsheet. You can also select an area of the sheet to be copied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436				0	br	Select the command \<emph\>Edit - Fill - Sheet\</emph\>. In the dialog which appears, the check box \<emph\>Numbers\</emph\> must be selected (or \<emph\>Paste All\</emph\>) if you want to combine operations with the values. You can also choose the desired operation here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	br	In contrast to copying an area to the clipboard, you can filter certain information and calculate values. This command is only visible if you have selected two sheets in the document. To select multiple sheets, click each sheet tab while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> or Shift.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	br	\<variable id=\"tabellenfuellentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillTable\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the options for transferring spreadsheets or ranges of a certain spreadsheet.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	br	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> and click the tab of the worksheet where you want to insert the contents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	br	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	br	This dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\" name=\"Paste Contents\"\>Paste Contents\</link\> dialog, where you can find additional tips.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
