helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150086				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteColumns\"\>After selecting at least one cell, deletes the entire column from the sheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150751				0	br	This area contains options for specifying how sheets are displayed after deleting cells.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_DELCELL:BTN_CELLSUP\"\>Fills the space produced by the deleted cells with the cells underneath it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	br	\<variable id=\"zellenloeschentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteCell\"\>Completely deletes selected cells, columns or rows. The cells below or to the right of the deleted cells will fill the space.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Note that the selected delete option is stored and reloaded when the dialog is next called.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_DELCELL:BTN_CELLSLEFT\"\>Fills the resulting space by the cells to the right of the deleted cells.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
