helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153193				0	br	\<variable id=\"tabelleloeschentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Remove\"\>Deletes the current sheet after query confirmation.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
