helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	br	To hide the column and row headers unmark this menu entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	br	You can also set the view of the column and row headers in \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060100.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Spreadsheet - View\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
