helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151384				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03080000.xhp\" name=\"Value Highlighting\"\>Value Highlighting\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863	5			0	br	To remove the highlighting, unmark the menu entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785	4			0	br	Text cells are formatted in black, number cells in blue, and all other types of cells, such as formulas, logical values, and dates, are formatted in green.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188	3			0	br	If this function is active, colors that you define in the document will not be displayed. When you deactivate the function, the user-defined colors are displayed again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
