helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146902				0	br	In row 14, under Age, enter 7, 8, 9, and so on, one after the other. The variance of the weight values for all children of this age attending Joe's birthday party appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
