helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBAUSZUG\"\>DGET returns the contents of the referenced cell in a database which matches the specified search criteria.\</ahelp\> In case of an error, the function returns either #VALUE! for no row found, or Err502 for more than one cell found.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
