helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153273	187			0	br	For the Database Field parameter you can enter a cell to specify the column, or enter the number 0 for the entire database. The parameter cannot be empty. \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/01/04060101.xhp#quotes\"/\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536				0	br	In row 14, under Age, enter 7, 8, 9, and so on, one after the other. The result shown is the standard deviation of the weight of all children of this age.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
