helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155587				0	br	In row 14, under Age, enter 7, 8, 9, and so on, one after the other. The average weight of all children of the same age appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155596				0	br	Charles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
