helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155766				0	br	The range A1:E10 lists the children invited to Joe's birthday party. The following information is given for each entry: column A shows the name, B the grade, then age in years, distance to school in meters and weight in kilograms.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
