helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id1953489				0	br	When you copy and paste cells containing date values between different spreadsheets, both spreadsheet documents must be set to the same date base. If date bases differ, the displayed date values will change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
