helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146099				0	br	Use this function to calculate the amount of money needed to be invested at a fixed rate today, to receive a specific amount, an annuity, over a specified number of periods. You can also determine how much money is to remain after the elapse of the period. Specify as well if the amount is to be paid out at the beginning or at the end of each period.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146108				0	br	The amount received on the maturity date is calculated as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
