helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3153257				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_GCD\"\> The result is the greatest common divisor of a list of numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
