helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155701				0	br	=MULTINOMIAL(F11:H11) returns 1260, if F11 to H11 contain the values 2, 3 and 4. This corresponds to the formula =(2+3+4)! / (2!*3!*4!)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155818				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCCOT\"\>Returns the inverse cotangent of the given number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
