helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156267				0	br	If you enter the number -0.1, -1 will be returned as the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156296				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCSIN\"\>Returns the inverse trigonometric sine of a number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
