helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157205				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_UNGERADE\"\>Rounds a positive number up to the nearest odd integer and a negative number down to the nearest odd integer.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
