helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157283				0	br	If you enter the number 1.01, 3 will be returned as the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157432				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_UNTERGRENZE\"\>Rounds a number down to the nearest multiple of Significance.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
