helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159134				0	br	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value, whose inverse trigonometric cosine value is to be calculated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159192				0	br	=GCD_ADD(5;15;25) returns 5.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
