helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159495				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_POTENZ\"\>Returns the result of a number raised to a power.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
