helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159594				0	br	If you enter 3 as the base and -2 as the power, 0.11 will be returned as the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3160368				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_QUADRATESUMME\"\>If you want to calculate the sum of the squares of numbers (totaling up of the squares of the arguments), enter these into the text fields.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
