helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163297				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_AUFRUNDEN\"\>Rounds a number up, according to the specified decimal place.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
