helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163426				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SINHYP\"\>Returns the hyperbolic sine of a number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
