helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163471				0	br	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the number whose hyperbolic sine is to be calculated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163504				0	br	If you enter the value -5, -74.2 will be returned as the hyperbolic sine.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163625				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMME\"\>Adds all the numbers in a range of cells.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
