helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163988				0	br	=FLOOR( -11; -2; 1) returns -10				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164115				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VORZEICHEN\"\>Returns the sign of a number. \</ahelp\> The function returns the result 1 for a positive sign and -1 for a negative sign. If the number is zero, then the function likewise produces a zero.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
