helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164197				0	br	If you enter the number 3.4, 1 will be returned as the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164212				0	br	If you enter the number -4.5, -1 will be returned as the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164288				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_MROUND\"\>The result is the nearest integer multiple of the number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
