helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164829				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZUFALLSZAHL\"\>Returns a random number between 0 and 1.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
