helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165508				0	br	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the number whose hyperbolic tangent is to be calculated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165541				0	br	If you enter the value -5, the system returns the hyperbolic tangent -1.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165682				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TEILERGEBNIS\"\>Calculates subtotals.\</ahelp\> If a range already contains subtotals, these are not used for further calculations. Use this function with the AutoFilters to take only the filtered records into account.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
