helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3581652				0	br	=COUNTIF(A1:A10;2006) - this returns 1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3591723				0	br	SQRT(-16) returns an \<item type=\"literal\"\>invalid argument\</item\> error.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
