helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3939634				0	br	RADIANS(90) returns 1.5707963267949, which is PI/2 to Calc's accuracy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id4136478				0	br	ISODD(-3.1) returns TRUE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
