helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5818659				0	br	An error results if \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is between -1 and 1 inclusive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5833307				0	br	ROUNDDOWN(45.67; 0) returns 45.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
