helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6386913				0	br	To count only negative numbers: COUNTIF(A1:A10;"<0")				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6393932				0	br	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> must be greater than or equal to 1.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6670125				0	br	=SUMIF(A1:A10;">0";B1:10) - sums values from the range B1:B10 only if the corresponding values in the range A1:A10 are >0.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id679647				0	br	To return the angle in degrees, use the DEGREES function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6807458				0	br	COMBIN returns the number of ways to choose these items. For example if there are 3 items A, B and C in a set, you can choose 2 items in 3 different ways, namely AB, AC and BC.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6814477				0	br	The cotangent of an angle is equivalent to 1 divided by the tangent of that angle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6853846				0	br	ASIN(1) returns 1.5707963267949 (PI/2 radians). 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6870021				0	br	\<emph\>number\</emph\> must be positive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7050080				0	br	TRUNC(-1.234999; 3) returns -1.234. All the 9s are lost.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id708639				0	br	=COUNTIF(A1:A10;B1) - this returns 1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7112338				0	br	Returns an integer random number between integers \<emph\>bottom\</emph\> and \<emph\>top\</emph\> (both inclusive).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7154759				0	br	ISEVEN(0) returns TRUE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7414471				0	br	COMBIN implements the formula: count_1!/(count_2!*(count_1-count_2)!)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7700430				0	br	ROUNDUP(1.2345; 1) returns 1.3.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
