helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144916				0	br	\<emph\>Array X\</emph\> represents the first array whose elements are to be squared and added.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144936				0	br	\<emph\>Array Y\</emph\> represents the second array whose elements are to be squared and subtracted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3145055				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMEX2PY2\"\>Returns the sum of the sum of squares of corresponding values in two arrays.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
