helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3151260				0	br	Without deselecting the range, select the MUNIT function. Mark the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> check box. Enter the desired dimensions for the array unit, in this case 5, and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
