helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154176				0	br	This function returns an array and is handled in the same way as the other array functions. Select a range for the answers and then the function. Select Data_Y. If you want, you can enter other parameters. Select \<emph\>Array\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
