helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154798				0	br	After you have made changes, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
