helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3147239	107			0	br	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> may take the values 1, 0, or -1. If Type = 1 or if this optional parameter is missing, it is assumed that the first column of the search array is sorted in ascending order. If Type = -1 it is assumed that the column in sorted in descending order. This corresponds to the same function in Microsoft Excel.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
