helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152986				0	br	\<variable id=\"texttext\"\>This section contains descriptions of the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> functions. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049	12			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DM\"\>Converts a number to an amount in the currency format, rounded to a specified decimal place.\</ahelp\> In the \<emph\>value\</emph\> field enter the number to be converted to currency. Optionally, you may enter the number of decimal places in the \<emph\>decimals\</emph\> field. If no value is specified, all numbers in currency format will be displayed with two decimal places. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153063	154			0	br	\<emph\>number\</emph\> specifies the number of characters in the part of the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153152	100			0	br	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) specifies the number of characters for the start text. If this parameter is not defined, one character is returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153224	82			0	br	\<emph\>text_1\</emph\> refers to the first text to compare.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153289				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_BASIS\"\>Converts a positive integer to a specified base into a text from the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#zahlensystem\" name=\"numbering system\"\>numbering system\</link\>.\</ahelp\> The digits 0-9 and the letters A-Z are used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153318	253			0	br	\<emph\>Mode\</emph\> (optional) indicates the degree of simplification. The higher the value, the greater is the simplification of the Roman number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153350	118			0	br	\<emph\>number\</emph\> (optional) is the number of characters from the right part of the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546	18			0	br	DOLLAR(255) returns $255.00.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
