helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3152893				0	br	Type: Calculates the type of difference. Possible values are 0 (interval) and 1 (in calendar years).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153066				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DIFFMONTHS\"\>Calculates the difference in months between two dates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153249				0	br	Text: Enter the character string to be encrypted. ROT13(ROT13(Text)) decrypts the code.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153340				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DIFFWEEKS\"\>Calculates the difference in weeks between two dates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153803				0	br	Date: Any date in the respective year. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	br	DAYSINYEAR(A1) returns 366 days if A1 contains 2/29/68, a valid date for the year 1968.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
