helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3150038	33			0	br	For all \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>Shared Library \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>DLL\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> functions, the following applies:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
