helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3152981				0	br	Returns the number of functions without the management functions of the reference parameter. Each function has a unique number between 0 and nCount-1. This number will be needed for the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\" name=\"GetFunctionData\"\>GetFunctionData\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\" name=\"GetParameterDescription\"\>GetParameterDescription\</link\> functions later.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
