helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E62				0	br	If the payments take place at regular intervals, use the IRR function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_idN11138				0	br	If the payments take place at regular intervals, use the NPV function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
