helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3156130	101			0	br	=TRIMMEAN(A1:A50; 0.1) calculates the mean value of numbers in A1:A50, without taking into consideration the 5 percent of the values representing the highest values and the 5 percent of the values representing the lowest ones. The percentage numbers refer to the amount of the untrimmed mean value, not to the number of summands.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3156257				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GEOMITTEL\"\>Returns the geometric mean of a sample.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
