helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:FID_FUNCTION_BOX:LB_FUNC\"\>Displays the available functions.\</ahelp\> When you select a function, the area below the list box displays a short description. To insert the selected function double-click it or click the \<emph\>Insert Function into calculation sheet\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
