helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AddPrintArea\"\>Adds the current selection to the defined print areas.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
