helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ParaStyle\"\>Displays the list of the available Cell Styles for \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"indirect cell formatting\"\>indirect cell formatting\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
