helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147003				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PageStyle\"\>Displays the Page Styles available for indirect page formatting.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147299				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TEMPLATE_FILTER\"\>Lists the available style groups.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	br	Use the Styles and Formatting window to assign styles to objects and text sections. You can update Styles, modify existing Styles or create new Styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147501				0	br	Update Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148609				0	br	Click a cell to format it, or drag your mouse over a certain range to format the whole range. Repeat this action for other cells and ranges.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	br	Click the \<emph\>Fill Format Mode\</emph\> again to exit this mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	br	The Styles and Formatting \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dockable window\"\>dockable window\</link\> can remain open while editing the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150050				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3154649\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_styleupdatebyexample.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154649\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
