helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ClearArrows\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Removes all tracer arrows from the spreadsheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
