helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowErrors\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Draws tracer arrows to all precedent cells which cause an error value in a selected cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
