helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCPAGE_SORT_OPTIONS:LB_SORT_USER\"\> Select the custom sort order that you want to apply. To define a custom sort order, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists\"\> Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists\</link\> .\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
