helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_SUBT_GROUP1\"\>Specify the settings for up to three subtotal groups. Each tab has the same layout.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145647				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SUBT_FUNC\"\>Select the mathematical function that you want to use to calculate the subtotals.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147125				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SUBT_COLS\"\>Select the column(s) containing the values that you want to subtotal.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	br	To insert subtotal values into a table:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460				0	br	In the \<emph\>Use function\</emph\> box, select the function that you want to use to calculate the subtotals.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	br	In the \<emph\>Calculate subtotals for\</emph\> box, select the check boxes for the columns containing the values that you want to subtotal.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	4			0	br	Select the table or the area in the table that you want to calculate subtotals for, and then choose \<emph\>Data – Subtotals\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SUBT_GROUP\"\>Select the column that you want to control the subtotal calculation process. If the contents of the selected column change, the subtotals are automatically recalculated.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154321				0	br	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	br	Ensure that the columns of the table have labels.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	br	In the \<emph\>Group By\</emph\> box, select the column that you want to add the subtotals to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
