helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229	20			0	br	$[officename] automatically adds a caption to buttons that are dragged into the \<emph\>Data Fields \</emph\>area. The caption contains the name of the data field as well as the formula that created the data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	br	The DataPilot displays data fields as buttons which you can drag and drop to define the DataPilot table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
