helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149403				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTSUBT:CB_SHOWALL\"\>Includes empty columns and rows in the results table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149581				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTSUBT:BTN_USER\"\>Select this option, and then click the type of subtotal that you want to calculate in the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	br	Lists the name of the selected data field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3151113				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_PIVOTSUBT\"\>Specify the subtotals that you want to calculate.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTSUBT:BTN_NONE\"\>Does not calculate subtotals.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	br	The contents of this dialog is different for data fields in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> area, and data fields in the\<emph\> Row\</emph\> or\<emph\> Column\</emph\> area of the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090102.xhp\" name=\"DataPilot\"\>DataPilot\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:MULTILISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTSUBT:LB_FUNC\"\>Click the type of subtotal that you want to calculate. This option is only available if the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> option is selected.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155856				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_PIVOTSUBT:BTN_AUTO\"\>Automatically calculates subtotals.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	br	More				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F0				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Expands or reduces the dialog. The \<emph\>More\</emph\> button is visible for data fields only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F3				0	br	Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F7				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090106.xhp\"\>Data Field Options\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button is visible for column, row, or page fields only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10708				0	br	If the dialog is expanded by the \<emph\>More\</emph\> button, the following items are added to the dialog:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070B				0	br	Displayed value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070F				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For each data field, you can select the type of display.\</ahelp\> For some types you can select additional information for a base field and a base item.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	br	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371266\"\>Select the type of calculating of the displayed value for the data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10724				0	br	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072A				0	br	Displayed value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	br	Normal				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	br	Results are shown unchanged				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073E				0	br	Difference from				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10744				0	br	From each result, its reference value (see below) is subtracted, and the difference is shown. Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	br	\<emph\>Named item\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074C				0	br	If a base item name is specified, the reference value for a combination of field items is the result where the item in the base field is replaced by the specified base item.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074F				0	br	\<emph\>Previous item or Next item\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10754				0	br	If "previous item" or "next item" is specified as the base item, the reference value is the result for the next visible member of the base field, in the base field's sort order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	br	% Of				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10761				0	br	Each result is divided by its reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076A				0	br	% Difference from				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10770				0	br	From each result, its reference value is subtracted, and the difference is divided by the reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10777				0	br	Running total in				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	br	Each result is added to the sum of the results for preceding items in the base field, in the base field's sort order, and the total sum is shown.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	br	Results are always summed, even if a different summary function was used to get each result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10787				0	br	% of row				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078D				0	br	Each result is divided by the total result for its row in the DataPilot table. If there are several data fields, the total for the result's data field is used. If there are subtotals with manually selected summary functions, the total with the data field's summary function is still used. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	br	% of column				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079A				0	br	Same as "% of row", but the total for the result's column is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A1				0	br	% of total				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A7				0	br	Same as "% of row", but the grand total for the result's data field is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AE				0	br	Index				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B4				0	br	The row and column totals and the grand total, following the same rules as above, are used to calculate the following expression:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B7				0	br	( original result * grand total ) / ( row total * column total )				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BA				0	br	Base field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BE				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371267\"\>Select the field from which the respective value is taken as base for the calculation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C1				0	br	Base item				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C5				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371268\"\>Select the item of the base field from which the respective value is taken as base for the calculation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Data field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	bm_id711386				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>hiding;data fields, from calculations in Data Pilot\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>display options in Data Pilot\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sorting;options in Data Pilot\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>data field options for Data Pilot\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10542				0	br	Data Field Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10546				0	br	You can specify additional options for column, row, and page data fields in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\"\>DataPilot\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	br	Sort by				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055B				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387653\"\>Select the data field that you want to sort columns or rows by.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	br	Ascending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384580\"\>Sorts the values from the lowest value to the highest value, that is, from A to Z or from 1 to 9. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	br	Descending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384581\"\>Sorts the values descending from the highest value to the lowest value, that is from Z to A or from 9 to 1. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	br	Manual				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10570				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384582\"\>Sorts values alphabetically, that is , from A to Z.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10585				0	br	Display options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	br	You can specify the display options for all row fields except for the last, innermost row field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	br	Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387654\"\>Select the layout mode for the field in the list box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10593				0	br	Empty line after each item				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495385090\"\>Adds an empty row after the data for each item in the DataPilot table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059A				0	br	Show automatically				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059E				0	br	Displays the top or bottom nn items when you sort by a specified field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A1				0	br	Show				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A5				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495385091\"\>Turns on the automatic show feature.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A8				0	br	items				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AC				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495390209\"\>Enter the maximum number of items that you want to show automatically.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AF				0	br	From				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B3				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387655\"\>Shows the top or bottom items in the specified sort order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	br	Using field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BA				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387656\"\>Select the data field that you want to sort the data by.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BD				0	br	Hide items				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"59010\"\>Select the items that you want to hide from the calculations.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	br	Hierarchy				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C8				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387657\"\>Select the hierarchy that you want to use. The DataPilot must be based on an external source data that contains data hierarchies.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
