helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RecalcPivotTable\"\>Updates the DataPilot table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	br	After you import an Excel spreadsheet that contains a Pivot table, click in the table, and then choose \<emph\>Data - DataPilot - Refresh\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
