helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_networkdays.xhp	0	help	par_id3151110				0	br	\<emph\>End date\</emph\>: the date up until when the calculation is carried out. If the end date is a workday, the day is included in the calculation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
