helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Number format: Currency				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\02\02140000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149260				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>percentage calculations\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\02\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156329				0	br	\<link href=\"text/scalc/02/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Number format: Percent\"\>Number format: Percent\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
