helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145140				0	br	Displays the note that is attached to the current cell				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145162				0	br	Opens the Function Wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145209				0	br	Creates a document template.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
