helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978				0	br	To delete the contents of selected cells, press Delete. This opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Delete Contents\"\>Delete Contents\</link\> dialog, where you choose which contents of the cell you want to delete. To delete the contents of selected cells without a dialog, press the Backspace key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147482				0	br	Turns additional selection mode on or off. In this mode, you can use the arrow keys to extend the selection. You can also click in another cell to extend the selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	br	Changes the focus by moving forwards through the areas and buttons of the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148444				0	br	Standard format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148568				0	br	Switches to Edit mode and places the cursor at the end of the contents of the current cell. Press again to exit Edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148649				0	br	Copies or moves the current field into the "Data" area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148800				0	br	Standard percentage format (two decimal places)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148822				0	br	Standard date format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148882				0	br	where (*) is the multiplication sign on the numeric key pad				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149054				0	br	Moves the cursor to the bottom edge of the current data range. If the row below the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves down to the next row that contains data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149152				0	br	Moves the focus up one item in the current dialog area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149196				0	br	Two decimal places, thousands separator				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149197				0	br	Open Format Cells dialog				2002-02-02 02:02:02
