helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417				0	br	The following table shows the effects of rounding, thousands delimiters (,), decimal delimiters (.) and the placeholders # and 0.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
