helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153361				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>cells; selecting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>marking cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>selecting;cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>multiple cells selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>selection modes in spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; selecting ranges\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
