helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340	13			0	br	The command is not visible if the sheet was opened with write protection on. In that case, click the \<emph\>Edit File \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> Bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
