helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D7				0	br	\<variable id=\"printranges\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/printranges.xhp\"\>Defining Print Ranges on a Sheet\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN108F5				0	br	You can define which range of cells on a spreadsheet to print.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FB				0	br	The cells on the sheet that are not part of the defined print range are not printed or exported. Sheets without a defined print range are not printed and not exported to a PDF file, unless the document uses the Excel file format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
