helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10937				0	br	Choose \<emph\>View - Page Break Preview\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093E				0	br	In the \<emph\>Page Break Preview\</emph\>, print ranges as well as page break regions are outlined by a blue border and contain a centered page number in gray. Nonprinting areas have a gray background.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10944				0	br	To change the size of a print range, drag a border of the range to a new location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10948				0	br	To clear a print range, drag a border of the range onto the opposite border of the range.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
