helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\specialfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	br	Once you have created a filter matrix, select the sheet ranges to be filtered. Open the \<emph\>Advanced Filter\</emph\> dialog by choosing \<emph\>Data - Filter - Advanced Filter\</emph\>, and define the filter conditions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\specialfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153286				0	br	170000				2002-02-02 02:02:02
