helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	br	Open the context menu for the selected character and choose \<emph\>Character\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Character\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	br	If, for example, you want to write H20 with a subscript 2, select the 2 in the cell (not in the input line).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	br	Click the \<emph\>Font Position\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
