helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154710				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:EDIT:DLG_TITLE:EDT_Z_AXIS\"\>Marking the \<emph\>Z axis\</emph\> option activates the subtitle. Enter the desired title in the corresponding text field.\</ahelp\> This option is only available for 3-D charts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
