helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	br	\<variable id=\"statistik\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertStatistics\"\>Use the\<emph\> Statistics \</emph\>dialog to determine if you want to display statistical functions when working with 2D objects, such as mean, error category or regression.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149870				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:METRICFIELD:TP_STAT:MTR_FLD_BIGERROR\"\>Displays the highest error margin in % according to the highest value of the data group.\</ahelp\> Set the percentage in the spin button to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150048				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:METRICFIELD:TP_STAT:MTR_FLD_PERCENT\"\>Displays a percentage. The display refers to the corresponding data point. \</ahelp\> Set the percentage in the spin box to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150202				0	br	In\<emph\> Error category \</emph\>area, you can select the individual types of display for the error category in question.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150539				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCH_CT_INDICATE2\"\>Specifies the error indicator.\</ahelp\> You can choose between \<emph\>No Indicators, Indicators Top and Bottom, Lower\</emph\> and \<emph\>Upper Indicator\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:METRICFIELD:TP_STAT:MTR_FLD_MINUS\"\>Displays the constant value in percentage.\</ahelp\> Set the positive value in the + spin box and the negative value in the\<emph\> -\</emph\> spin box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153249				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:RADIOBUTTON:TP_STAT:RBT_SIGMA\"\>Displays the standard deviation (square root of the variance).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	br	The\<emph\> Insert - Statistics \</emph\>menu item is only available for 2D objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
