helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284				0	br	\<variable id=\"objekteigenschaften\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DiagramObjects\"\>Assigns certain properties to the selected object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Depending on the object selected, the command open dialogs that you can also open by choosing the following commands from the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> menu:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
