helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149121				0	br	Any changes made only affect this one data point. For example, if you edit the color of a bar, only the color of that bar will be different.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	br	This dialog allows you to change the properties of a selected data point. The dialog appears when there is only one data point selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Object Properties\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
