helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DiagramAxisA\"\>Opens a dialog where you can edit the properties of the secondary X axis. To insert a secondary X axis, choose \<emph\>Insert - Axes\</emph\> and select \<emph\>X axis\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150441				0	br	A submenu for editing axes properties appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
