helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\choose_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id7085787				0	br	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\choose_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id7309488				0	br	Choose from the following chart types, depending on data type and intended presentation effect.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
