helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	hd_id1536606				0	br	\<variable id=\"wiz_chart_type\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard - Chart Type\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
