helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"chart\"\>$[officename] lets you present data graphically in a chart, so that you can visually compare data series and view trends in the data. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
