helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750				0	br	\<variable id=\"duplicate_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/duplicate_object.xhp\" name=\"Duplicating Objects\"\>Duplicating Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
