helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129				0	br	Use the \<emph\>Ellipse\</emph\> tool to draw a solid yellow ellipse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149209				0	br	Select the ellipse and choose \<emph\>Edit - Duplicate\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	br	You can create duplicate or multiple copies of an object. The copies can be identical or can differ in size, color, orientation and location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149947				0	br	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to create the duplicates.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151192				0	br	Enter a negative value for the \<emph\>Width\</emph\> and \<emph\>Height\</emph\> so that the coins decrease in size as you go up the stack.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	br	To define a color transition for the coins, select different colors in the \<emph\>Start\</emph\> and \<emph\>End\</emph\> boxes. The \<emph\>Start\</emph\> color is applied to the object that you are duplicating.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	br	The following example creates a stack of coins by making multiple copies of a single ellipse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153935				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Duplicate\"\>Edit - Duplicate\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Duplicating Objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
