helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150752				0	br	To connect lines:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257				0	br	To create a closed object, right-click a line and choose \<emph\>Close Object\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3150363	9			0	br	You can only use the \<emph\>Close Object\</emph\> command on connected lines, \<emph\>Freeform Lines \</emph\>and unfilled \<emph\>Curves\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	br	Select two or more lines.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3154512				0	br	When you connect lines, lines are drawn between neighboring endpoints.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3156383				0	br	Right-click and choose \<emph\>Modify - Connect\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
