helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145587				0	br	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Tab\</item\> until you reach the object you want to select.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3146971				0	br	Press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Right\</item\> arrow key until you reach the toolbar icon of a drawing tool.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	br	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	br	You can create and edit drawing objects using the keyboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152990				0	br	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+F6\</item\> to enter the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	br	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F6\</item\> to navigate to the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154705				0	br	The object is created at the center of the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155062				0	br	You can use the arrow keys to position the object where you want. To choose a command from the context menu for the object, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift+F10\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962				0	br	To return to the document, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+F6\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	br	If there is an arrow next to the icon, the drawing tool opens a sub toolbar. Press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Up\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Down\</item\> arrow key to open the sub toolbar, then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Right\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Left\</item\> key to select an icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
