helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3163714	56			0	br	\<variable id=\"wahr\"\>If an error occurs, the function returns a logical or numerical value. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id6909390				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Applies all changes and closes the wizard.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id7493209				0	br	In the Basic IDE, a spin button is the name used for the numerical field together with the two arrow symbols.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id9345377				0	br	\<variable id=\"ShiftF1\"\>Press Shift+F1 and point to a control to learn more about that control. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
