helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	br	If you drag an object over the edge of a hidden docked window, the window opens in AutoShow mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149948				0	br	Every \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"docked\"\>docked\</link\> window has an icon to control the display properties of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	br	To show or hide a docked window, click the icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153257				0	br	The docked window closes automatically when you move the mouse pointer outside of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	br	Multiple docked windows act as a single window in AutoShow/AutoHide mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
