helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148799				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TEMPLATEDLG_TB_PRINT\"\>Allows you to preview the template or document, as well as view the document properties.\</ahelp\> To preview the template or document, click the \<emph\>Preview\</emph\> icon at the top of the Preview box on the right side of the dialog. To view the properties of the document, click the \<emph\>Document Properties\</emph\> icon at the top of the Preview box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
