helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3148620	11			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_LAB_LAB_LB_DATABASE\"\>Select the database that you want to use as the data source for your label. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_LAB_LAB_BOX_TYPE\"\>Select the size format that you want to use. The available formats depend on the brand on what you selected in the \<emph\>Brand\</emph\> list. If you want to use a custom label format, select \<emph\>[User]\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010202.xhp\" name=\"Format\"\>\<emph\>Format\</emph\>\</link\> tab to define the format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149750	15			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_TP_LAB_LAB_BTN_INSERT\"\>Select the database field that you want, and then click the arrow to the left of this box to insert the field into the \<emph\>Label text\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762	18			0	br	You can select a pre-defined size format for your label or a size format that you specify on the \<emph\>Format \</emph\>tab..				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_LAB_LAB_LB_TABLE\"\>Select the database table containing the field(s) that you want to use in your label.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150466				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_LAB_LAB_BOX_MAKE\"\>Select the brand of paper that you want to use.\</ahelp\> Each brand has its own size formats.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150838				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MULTILINEEDIT_TP_LAB_LAB_EDT_WRITING\"\>Enter the text that you want to appear on the label. You can also insert a database field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151339				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_RADIOBUTTON_TP_LAB_LAB_BTN_CONT\"\>Prints labels on continuous paper.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	br	The paper type and the dimensions of the label are displayed at the bottom of the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	br	The name of the database field is bounded by brackets in the \<emph\>Label text\</emph\> box. If you want, you can separate database fields with spaces. Press Enter to insert a database field on a new line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_LAB_LAB\"\>Specify the label text and choose the paper size for the label.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153089				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_LAB_LAB_BOX_ADDR\"\>Creates a label with your return address. Text that is currently in the \<emph\>Label text\</emph\> box is overwritten.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
