helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153099				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GLBLTREE_DEL\"\>Deletes the selection from the Navigator list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153105				0	br	This command is found by right-clicking an inserted file in the Navigator.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GLBLTREE_EDIT_LINK\"\>Changes the link properties for the selected file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	br	Switches between master view and normal view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
