helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	br	You can also insert files into the master document by dragging a file from your desktop and dropping on the master view of the Navigator.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154154				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GLBLTREEUPD_ALL\"\>Updates all contents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
