helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147046				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_IMAPDLG_FREEPOLY\"\>Draws a hotspot that is based on a freeform polygon. Click this icon and move to where you want to draw the hotspot. Drag a freeform line and release to close the shape. After, you can enter the \<emph\>Address and the Text\</emph\> for the hotspot, and then select the \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> where you want the URL to open.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
