helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356				0	br	When you rest the mouse pointer over a change markup in the document, a \<emph\>Tip\</emph\> displays the author and the date and time that the change was made.\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\> If the \<emph\>Extended Tips\</emph\> are activated, the type of change and any attached comments are also displayed. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
