helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426	5			0	br	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Comments are displayed as callouts in the sheet when you rest your mouse pointer over a cell with a recorded change. You can also view comments that are attached to a changed cell in the changes list in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230400.xhp\" name=\"Accept or Reject Changes\"\>\<emph\>Accept or Reject Changes\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
