helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154471				0	br	To delete a record in the current table, right-click the row header of the record, and then select \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>. \<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETEROWS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155311				0	br	To display all of the records in a table, click the \<emph\>Remove Filter\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356				0	br	Use the toolbar to select a table in the bibliography database, to search for records, or to sort the records using filters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
