helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157960				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GRID_TRAVEL_ABSOLUTE\"\>Type the number of the record that you want to display, and then press Enter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
