helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145173				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_ZOOM:BTN_150\"\>Displays the document at one and a half times its actual size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147353				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_ZOOM:BTN_100\"\>Displays the document at its actual size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"massstabtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Zoom\"\>Reduces or enlarges the screen display of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The current zoom factor is displayed as a percentage value on the \<emph\>Status\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655				0	br	Zooming is handled differently on Unix, Linux, and Windows platforms. A document saved with a 100% zoom factor in Windows is displayed at a larger zoom factor on Unix/Linux platforms. To change the zoom factor, double-click or right-click the percentage value on the \<emph\>Status\</emph\> bar, and select the zoom factor that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MNU_ZOOM_WHOLE_PAGE\"\>Displays the entire page on your screen.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152791				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_ZOOM:BTN_75\"\>Displays the document at 75% of its actual size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154389				0	br	Set the zoom factor at which to display the current document and all documents of the same type that you open thereafter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156005				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_ZOOM:BTN_50\"\>Displays the document at half of its actual size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159125				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXDLG_ZOOM:ED_USER\"\>Allows you to enter the zoom factor at which you want to display the document. Click here, and then enter a percentage in the box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159151				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_ZOOM:BTN_200\"\>Displays the document at two times its actual size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
