helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	br	To insert a scanned image, the driver for your scanner must be installed. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>Under UNIX systems, install the SANE package found at http://www.mostang.com/sane/. The SANE package must use the same libc as $[officename].\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
