helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3157811				0	br	[NatNum4] Transliteration in				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3157870				0	br	All temperatures below zero are blue, temperatures between 0 and 30 °C are black, and temperatures higher than 30 °C are red.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
