helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_CHAR_POSITION_ED_HIGHLOW\"\>Enter the amount by which you want to raise or to lower the selected text in relation to the baseline. One hundred percent is equal to the height of the font.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
