helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150417				0	br	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Specify the alignment options for the cells on a printed page. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
