helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_PAGE:LB_LAYOUT\"\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Specify whether to apply the formatting to odd pages, even pages, or to both odd and even pages that use the current page style.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
