helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154380				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_PAGE_LB_TEXT_FLOW\"\>Select the text direction that you want to use in your document.\</ahelp\> The "right-to-left (vertical)" text flow direction rotates all layout settings to the right by 90 degrees, except for the header and footer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
