helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481	30			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:TRISTATEBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_AREA:TSB_STRETCH\"\>Stretches the bitmap to fill the selected object. To use this feature, clear the \<emph\>Tile \</emph\>box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
