helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_AREA:MTR_FLD_Y_SIZE\"\>Enter a height for the bitmap.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
