helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145416				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_GRADIENT:BTN_ADD\"\>Adds a custom gradient to the current list. Specify the properties of your gradient, and then click this button\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_GRADIENT:BTN_MODIFY\"\>Applies the current gradient properties to the selected gradient. If you want, you can save the gradient under a different name.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
