helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_GRADIENT:LB_COLOR_FROM\"\>Select a color for the beginning point of the gradient.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
