helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_GRADIENT:MTR_CENTER_Y\"\>Enter the vertical offset for the gradient, where 0% corresponds to the current vertical location of the endpoint color in the gradient. The endpoint color is the color that is selected in the \<emph\>To\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154812				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AREA_GRADIENT\"\>Set the properties of a gradient, or save and load gradient lists.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
