helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210300.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_GRADIENT:LB_GRADIENTS\"\>Select the type of gradient that you want to apply or create.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
