helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210400.xhp	0	help	par_id3144438				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_HATCH:LB_HATCHINGS\"\>Lists the available hatching patterns. Click the hatching pattern that you want to apply, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
