helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TPHATCH_CTRL\"\>Click a position in the grid to define the rotation angle for the hatch lines.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
