helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	br	Lists the available hatching patterns. You can also modify or create your own hatching pattern. To save the list, click the \<emph\>Save Hatches List\</emph\> button. To display a different list, click the \<emph\>Load Hatches List\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HATCH:BTN_SAVE\"\>Saves the current list of hatching patterns, so that you can load it later.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
