helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05250200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151264				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Moves the selected object up one level, so that it is closer to top of the stacking order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
