helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154297				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_STYLE_SLANTY\"\>Vertically slants the characters in the text object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154497				0	br	You can change the shape of the text baseline to match semicircles, arcs, circles, and freeform lines.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154636				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_SHOWFORM\"\>Shows or hides the text baseline, or the edges of the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154640				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_ADJUST_LEFT\"\>Aligns the text to the left end of the text baseline.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_ADJUST_MIRROR\"\>Reverses the text flow direction, and flips the text horizontally or vertically. To use this command, you must first apply a different baseline to the text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155515				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3159186\" src=\"svx/res/fw011.png\" width=\"0.2362inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159186\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155742				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_STYLE_UPRIGHT\"\>Uses the top or the bottom edge of the selected object as the text baseline and preserves the original vertical alignment of the individual characters.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155748				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3147217\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_centerpara.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147217\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_OUTLINE\"\>Shows or hides the borders of the individual characters in the text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3153142\" src=\"svx/res/fw06.png\" width=\"0.2362inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153142\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	br	This \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> dialog is only available for Fontwork in old Writer text documents that were created prior to %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION. You must first call \<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\> to add a menu command or an icon to open this dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156006				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3153573\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_alignleft.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153573\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
