helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	br	The bottom row contains the following baseline shapes: \<emph\>Open Circle, Closed Circle, Closed Circle II\</emph\>, and \<emph\>Open Circle Vertical\</emph\>. For the best results, the drawing object must contain more than two lines of text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
