helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145120				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290100.xhp\" name=\"Grouping\"\>Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290300.xhp\" name=\"Edit group\"\>Enter Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150603				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"Group\"\>Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150943				0	br	Working with groups				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152474				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290200.xhp\" name=\"Remove\"\>Ungroup\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152909				0	br	To edit the individual objects of a group, select the group, right-click, and then choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Enter Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Group - Enter Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Groups keep together selected objects, so that they can be moved or formatted as a single object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	br	Use Tab and Shift+Tab to move forwards and backwards through the objects in a group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154810				0	br	To exit a group, right-click, and then choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Exit Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Group - Exit Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	br	When you are editing a group, the objects that are not part of the group are faded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Group				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152823				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290100.xhp\" name=\"Group\"\>Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150008				0	br	The properties of individual objects are maintained even after you group the objects. You can nest groups, that is, you can have a group within a group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154689				0	br	\<variable id=\"gruppierentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormatGroup\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Groups the selected objects, so that they can be moved as a single object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Group				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159217				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290200.xhp\" name=\"Ungroup\"\>Ungroup\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146067				0	br	To break apart the nested groups within a group, you must repeat this command on each subgroup.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156116				0	br	\<variable id=\"aufhebentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormatUngroup\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Breaks apart the selected group into individual objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Ungroup				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083278				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290300.xhp\" name=\"Enter Group\"\>Enter Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146856				0	br	\<variable id=\"betretentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EnterGroup\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Opens the selected group, so that you can edit the individual objects. If the selected group contains nested group, you can repeat this command on the subgroups.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> This command does not permanently ungroup the objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290400.xhp\" name=\"Exit Group\"\>Exit Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"Groups\"\>Groups\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	par_id3157991	3			0	br	To select an individual object in a group,  hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>, and then click the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Enter Group				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157552				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290400.xhp\" name=\"Exit Group\"\>Exit Group\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147294				0	br	\<variable id=\"verlassentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:LeaveGroup\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Exits the group, so that you can no longer edit the individual objects in the group.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> If you are in a nested group, only the nested group is closed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
