helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	7			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXFLOAT_3D:BTN_LIGHT_8\"\>Click twice to turn the light source on, and then select a color for the light from the list. If you want, you can also set the color of the surrounding light, by selecting a color from the \<emph\>Ambient light\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> You can also press the Spacebar to turn the light source on or off. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
