helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010601.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053D				0	br	Edit Dictionary				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010601.xhp	0	help	par_idN10541				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Edit the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010600.xhp\"\>Chinese translation\</link\> terms.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010601.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	br	You can use this dialog to edit, to add, or to delete entries from the translation dictionary. The file path name for the translation dictionary is user/wordbook/commonterms.ctd. You cannot delete the default entries in this file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
