helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144439				0	br	Replaces one or two hyphens with a long dash (see the following table).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144445				0	br	Automatically applies a border at the base of the preceding paragraph when you type three or more specific characters, and then press Enter. To create a single line, type three or more hyphens (-), or underscores ( _ ), and then press Enter. To create a double line, type three or more equal signs (=), asterisks (*), tildes (~), or hash marks (#), and then press Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	br	1.1pt double underline				2002-02-02 02:02:02
