helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154690				0	br	0.5pt single underline				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	br	Replaces two or more consecutive spaces with a single space.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	br	Capitalizes the first letter of every sentence.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
