helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156180	65			0	br	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Changes quotation marks in the text to the quotation marks that you specify in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040400.xhp\" name=\"Custom Quotes\"\>Custom Quotes\</link\> tab of this dialog. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156299				0	br	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Replaces the custom paragraph styles in the current document with the "Default", the "Text Body", or the "Text Body Indent" paragraph style. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
