helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140402.xhp	0	help	par_id8224433				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to remove the selected icon from the list. Only user-defined icons can be removed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
