helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153029				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the file name of the document that you want to use to test the XSLT filter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
