helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06201000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10604				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"svx:CheckBox:RID_SVX_MDLG_HANGULHANJA_OPT:CB_IGNOREPOST\"\>Ignores positional characters at the end of Korean words when you search a dictionary.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
