helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\digitalsignatures.xhp	0	help	par_idN10548				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Adds and removes digital signatures to and from your document. You can also use the dialog to view certificates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
