helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\digitalsignatures.xhp	0	help	par_idN10563				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Lists the digital signatures for the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\digitalsignatures.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	br	The Signed icon \<image id=\"img_id4557023\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/signet_11x16.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"3.88mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id4557023\"\>icon\</alt\>\</image\> indicates a valid digital signature, while the Exclamation mark icon \<image id=\"img_id249336\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/caution_11x16.png\" width=\"4.23mm\" height=\"2.91mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id249336\"\>icon\</alt\>\</image\> indicates an invalid digital signature.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\digitalsignatures.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	br	A Signed icon is also shown in the Status bar when a signed document only contains valid digital signatures.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
