helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3145346				0	br	Themes are listed on the left side of the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_THEMELIST\"\>Click a theme to view the objects associated with the theme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983	47			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_LISTVIEW\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as small icons, with title and path information.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3148990				0	br	The \<emph\>Properties of (Theme)\</emph\> dialog contains the following tabs:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149783	46			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_ICONVIEW\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as icons.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_NEWTHEME\"\>Adds a new theme to the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>and lets you choose the files to include in the theme.\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Gallery\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, where you can select graphics and sounds to insert into your document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153032				0	br	To add a file to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, right-click a theme, choose \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Files \</emph\>tab, and then click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>. You can also click an object in the current document, hold, and then drag it to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	br	To zoom in or zoom out on a single object in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, double-click the object, or select the object, and then press the Spacebar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155355	50			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_WINDOW\"\>To insert a \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>object, select the object, and then drag it into the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	44			0	br	You can display the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as icons, or icons with titles and path information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
