helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the display options for guides.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/guides.xhp\"\>Guides\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057B				0	br	Display Guides				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057F				0	br	Displays or hides guides that you can use to align objects on a page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN10582				0	br	Snap to Guides				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN10586				0	br	Automatically aligns objects to vertical and horizontal guides. To override this feature, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Control key \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl key when you drag an object.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C6				0	br	Guides to Front				2002-02-02 02:02:02
