helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069C				0	br	Extensions that you add to "My Extensions" can only be used and managed by yourself.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AD				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"42769\"\>Select the directory where you want to add a new extension, or select the extensions that you want to remove, enable, disable, or export. To select multiple extensions, press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl\</item\> key when you click.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BA				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"2180256276\"\>Select a top-level node in the list box, and then click Add to add new extensions to that location.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BD				0	br	A file dialog opens where you can select the extensions that you want to add. To copy and to register the selected extensions, click Open.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D1				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"2180256277\"\>Select the extensions that you want to remove, and then click Remove.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
