helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1161534				0	br	The Data tab page of the Properties dialog for an XML Form document offers some XML forms settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1481063				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select or enter the name of a binding. Selecting the name of an existing binding associates the binding with the form control. Entering a new name creates a new binding and associates it with the form control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1589098				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the number of characters for a string.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id18616				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Declares the item as relevant.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1911679				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Declares that the item is calculated.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the button to open a dialog where you can enter the name of a new user-defined data type. The new data type inherits all facets from the currently selected data type.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id2318796				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies a regular expression pattern. Strings validated against the data type must conform to this pattern to be valid. The XSD data type syntax for regular expressions is different from the regular expression syntax used elseswhere in %PRODUCTNAME, for example in the Find & Replace dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3004547				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies if the item must be included on the XForm.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3341776				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Declares the item as a constraint.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3394573				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies an exclusive upper bound for values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3994567				0	br	The possible settings of the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of a control depend on the respective control. You will only see the options that are available for the current control and context. The following fields are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	br	The following lists all facets that are valid for data types. Some facets are only available for some data types.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a user-defined data type and click the button to delete the user-defined data type.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4331797				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies how whitespaces are to be handled when a string of the current data type is being processed. Possible values are Preserve, Replace, and Collapse. The sematics follow the definition at \<link href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#rf-whiteSpace\"\>http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#rf-whiteSpace\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4473403				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a data type which the control should be validated against.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4569231				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Declares the item as read-only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id5298318				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the maximum total number of digits that values of the decimal data type can have.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id5675527				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the maximum number of characters for a string.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id636921				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the DOM node to bind the control model to. Click the ... button for a dialog to enter the XPath expression.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id7599108				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies an inclusive upper bound for values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id8147221				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies an inclusive lower bound for values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id8746910				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the minimum number of characters for a string.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id9239173				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a model from the list of all models in the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id95828				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the maximum total number of fractional digits that values of the decimal data type can have.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id9759514				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies an exclusive lower bound for values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
