helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	br	Enter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	br	Places the cursor into the previous line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
