helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1110F				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Determines intervals to add or subtract with each activation of the spin box control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
