helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11391				0	br	This control is named "Multiline input" for a text column inside a table control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN113D2				0	br	If you select the text type "Multi-line with formatting", you cannot bind this control to a database field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN114EF				0	br	Word break				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11505				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays text on more than one line.\</ahelp\> Allows you to use line breaks in a text box, so that you can enter more than one line of text. To manually enter a line break, press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11538				0	br	Toggle				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1154E				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies if a Push Button behaves as a Toggle Button. If you set Toggle to "Yes", you can switch between the "selected" and "not selected" control states when you click the button or press the spacebar while the the control has the focus. A button in the "selected" state appears "pressed in".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11558				0	br	Take Focus on Click				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1156E				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If you set this option to "Yes", the Push Button receives the focus when you click the button.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11578				0	br	Hide selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1158E				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37965\"\>Specifies whether a text selection on a control remains selected when a the focus is no longer on a control.\</ahelp\> If you set \<emph\>Hide selection\</emph\> to "No", the selected text remains selected when the focus is no longer on the control that contains the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11598				0	br	Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115AE				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37966\"\>Specifies whether Check boxes and Option buttons are displayed in a 3D look (default) or a flat look.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115B7				0	br	Symbol color				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115B8				0	br	Border color				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115BB				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the color for symbols on controls, for example the arrows on a scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN115CE				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37967\"\>Specifies the border color for controls that have the Border property set to "flat".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B51				0	br	Small change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B55				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the value to add or subtract when the user clicks the arrow icon on the scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B6F				0	br	Large change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B70				0	br	Default scroll value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B73				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the value to add or subtract when the user clicks next to the slider at the scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B74				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DEFAULT_SCROLLVALUE\"\>Sets the default value for the scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FB6				0	br	Text lines end with				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FBA				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For text fields, select the line end code to be used when writing text into a database column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1209F				0	br	Acting on record				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120B1				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37930\"\>Specifies to show or hide the action items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Action items are the following: Save record, Undo, New record, Delete record, Refresh.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120BE				0	br	Positioning				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120D7				0	br	Navigation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120D9				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37928\"\>Specifies to show or hide the positioning items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Positioning items are the following: Record label, Record position, Record count label, Record count.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120DB				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37929\"\>Specifies to show or hide the navigation items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Navigation items are the following: First record, Previous record, Next record, Last record.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12156				0	br	Filtering / Sorting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1215A				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37931\"\>Specifies to show or hide the filtering and sorting items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Filtering and sorting items are the following: Sort ascending, Sort descending, Sort, Automatic filter, Default filter, Apply filter, Remove filter and order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12175				0	br	Icon Size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12179				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"37927\"\>Specifies whether the icons in a selected Navigation Bar should be small or large.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN122C4				0	br	Scale				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN122C8				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SCALEIMAGE\"\>Resizes the image to fit the size of the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12314				0	br	Visible size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12318				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the size of scrollbar thumb in "value units". A value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min." ) / 2 would result in a thumb which occupies half of the background area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12332				0	br	Orientation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12336				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the horizontal or vertical orientation for a scrollbar or spin box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12375				0	br	If set to 0, then the thumb's width will equal its height.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	General				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145641				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>controls; reference by SQL\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bound fields; controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>controls; bound fields/list contents/linked cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>list contents;controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells linked to controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>linked cells;controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>controls;assigning data sources\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
