helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN1114D				0	br	Drop-down list items are updated according to the change. The edit field of the combo box and the linked cell are not changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11163				0	br	Contents of the linked cell				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11167				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CELL_EXCHANGE_TYPE\"\>Select the mode of linking a list box with a linked cell on a spreadsheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11179				0	br	Linked contents: Synchronize the text contents of the selected list box entry with the cell contents. Select "The selected entry"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN1117D				0	br	Linked selection position: The position of the single selected item in the list box is synchronized with the numerical value in the cell. Select "Position of the selected entry"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN1118B				0	br	Source cell range				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN111A1				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LIST_CELL_RANGE\"\>Enter a cell range that contains the entries for a list box or combo box on a spreadsheet.\</ahelp\> If you enter a multi-column range, only the contents of the leftmost column are used to fill the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
