helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveUp\"\>Positions the selected paragraph before the one above it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
