helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144740				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Turns the edit mode for the current database table on or off.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	br	To make changes in a database used by more than one person, you must have the appropriate access rights. When you edit an external database, there is no intermediate storage by $[officename] of the changes made. They are sent directly to the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
