helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	br	$[officename] saves the current filter settings for the next time that you open this dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143281				0	br	\<variable id=\"standardfilter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FilterCrit\"\>Allows you to set the filtering options.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
