helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145211				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Exchange Database\</emph\> to select another table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSourceBrowser/DocumentDataSource\"\>Displays, in the data source browser, the table that is linked to the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
