helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12140000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Data Source of Current Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148668				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/13010000.xhp\" name=\"Setting Tabs\"\>Setting Tabs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	br	Initially the default tabs are shown on the horizontal ruler. Once you set a tab, only the default tabs to the right of the tab that you have set are available.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	br	On the ruler, set the tabs for the current paragraph, or all selected paragraphs, using the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Setting Tabs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148668				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>margins; setting with the mouse\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>columns; setting with the mouse\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text;indents, margins and columns\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; indents, margins and columns\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148668				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/13020000.xhp\" name=\"Setting Indents, Margins, and Columns\"\>Setting Indents, Margins, and Columns\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	br	Drag the top left mark to the right while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146130				0	br	If the cursor is placed in a table cell, you can change the indents for the contents of the cell by dragging them with the mouse on the ruler. You can change the boundary lines of the table on the ruler or by dragging the actual boundary line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146949				0	br	\<emph\>Task\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148453				0	br	Tabs that have been set are not changed when indenting a paragraph. If the set tabs end up outside the margins of the paragraph, they are no longer displayed, but they still exist.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150693				0	br	These icons mark the left indent for the first line of the current paragraph (top triangle) and the left indent for the other lines of the paragraph (bottom triangle).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3145071\" src=\"res/helpimg/linright.png\" width=\"9.26mm\" height=\"6.61mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145071\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152594				0	br	If you split the page into columns, or the cursor is placed in a multiple-column text frame, you can change the column width and the column spacing by dragging them on the ruler with the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	br	\<emph\>Procedure\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	br	Drag the mark on the right to the left while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	br	Set left indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	br	Drag the bottom left mark to the right while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154398				0	br	When an object, an image, or a draw object is selected, you will see the borders of the object in the ruler. You can change the borders by dragging them on the ruler with the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	br	In order to change the left indent starting with the second line of a paragraph, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, click the triangle on the bottom left, and drag it to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	br	You can define the indents and margins for the current paragraph, or for all selected paragraphs, using the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449				0	br	Set left indent of first line				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156136				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3153750\" src=\"res/helpimg/linleft.png\" width=\"4.23mm\" height=\"5.82mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153750\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	br	Set right indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	br	This icon on the right of the ruler marks the right indent of the current paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
