helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SbaExecuteSql\"\>Runs the SQL query and displays the query result.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Run Query\</emph\> function does not save the query.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149893	5			0	br	The\<emph\> Run Query \</emph\>function allows you to check the query. When you save the query, it is stored in the \<emph\>Query\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153684				0	br	Run Query				2002-02-02 02:02:02
