helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150935				0	br	Double-clicking this\<emph\> \</emph\>field opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/03010000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom\"\>Zoom\</link\> dialog, where you can change the current zoom factor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
