helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149748				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/20040000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Mode\"\>Insert Mode\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	br	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	br	OVER				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	br	\<emph\>Mode\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149388				0	br	INSRT				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363	2			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertMode\"\>Displays the current insert mode. You can toggle between INSRT = insert and OVER = overwrite.\</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>This field is only active if the cursor is in the input line of the formula bar or in a cell.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154422				0	br	Click in the field to toggle the modes (except in the $[officename] Basic IDE, since only the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> key is active). \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>If the cursor is positioned in a document, you may also use the Insert key to toggle the modes.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	br	\<emph\>Result\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	br	In the overwrite mode, any existing text is replaced by new text. The cursor is displayed as a thick vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
