helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	br	The graphic object is raised in brightness and reduced in contrast so that it can be used in the background as a watermark. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150255				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafMode\"\>Lists view attributes for the selected graphic object. The embedded or linked graphic object in the current file will not be changed, only the view of the object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3154515\" src=\"res/helpimg/zellvor.png\" width=\"1.4098inch\" height=\"0.2799inch\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154515\"\>Cell Styles\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	br	Graphics mode				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	br	The graphic object is shown in black and white. All brightness values below 50% will appear black, all over 50% will appear white.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	br	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also achieve tinted grayscale colors by raising one of the color parameters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	br	The view of the graphic object is not changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Graphics Mode				2002-02-02 02:02:02
