helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	br	You can open a context menu, which contains some of the most often-used commands.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146107				0	br	Switches between themes view and object view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146776				0	br	Opens the \<emph\>Enter Title\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146883				0	br	Toggles row selection, except when the row is in edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146894				0	br	Opens the Properties dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	br	Advances focus to the next section or element in a dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
