helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147075				0	br	Sets focus in previous subwindow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147081				0	br	Scroll up one screen.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100				0	br	Prints document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	br	By using \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and right or left arrow key, the cursor will jump from word to word; if you also hold down the Shift key, one word after the other is selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	br	Toggles the focused check box in a dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148408				0	br	Opens \<emph\>Templates and Documents\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148462				0	br	Redraws the document view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148537				0	br	Copies the selected items.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148606				0	br	Opens the context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148753				0	br	The \<emph\>Italic\</emph\> attribute is applied to the selected area. If the cursor is positioned in a word, this word is also marked in italic.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148757				0	br	Drag-and-drop can be used within and outside of a text box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148902				0	br	Jumps to the last entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149009				0	br	Ends Drawing Object selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149028				0	br	Toggles row selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149123				0	br	Opens a document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	br	Pressing ESC closes the dialog without saving changes. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>If you place the focus on a button, not only will you see the dotted line framing the name of the button, but also a thicker shadow under the button selected. This indicates that if you exit the dialog by pressing the Enter key, it is the equivalent of pressing that button itself.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149319				0	br	Selects the current column				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	br	Deletes the selected item(s) without putting them in the recycle bin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149440				0	br	Result				2002-02-02 02:02:02
