helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149527				0	br	Searches for the last entered search term.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582				0	br	When a folder is shown: goes up one level (goes back)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	br	Moves the focus to the previous section or element in a dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149753				0	br	In Rotation mode, the center of rotation can also be selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149785				0	br	A triple-click in a text input field selects the entire field. A triple-click in a text document selects the current sentence.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149800				0	br	Selects the next Gallery element above.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149816				0	br	Undoes last action.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149912				0	br	When positioned at the start of a header, a tab is inserted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149994				0	br	Leave the Point Selection mode. The drawing object is selected afterwards.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150048				0	br	Selects the next Gallery element on the left.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150085				0	br	Use the shortcut keys Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+S to open the \<emph\>Special Characters\</emph\> dialog to insert one or more special characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150090				0	br	Calls the \<emph\>Find & Replace\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150099				0	br	Refreshes the selected theme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345				0	br	Redoes last action.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	br	The \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z shortcut keys are used to undo modifications one step at a time; the text will then have the status it had before the first change.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
