helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	139			0	br	 $[officename] has an AutoComplete function which activates itself in some text and list boxes. For example, enter c:\\a into the URL field and the AutoComplete function displays the first file or first directory found on the C: drive that starts with the letter "a".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154055				0	br	Selects a Drawing Object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154059				0	br	Moves between areas (backwards)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
