helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146873				0	br	\<variable id=\"00000001\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000001.xhp\" name=\"Getting Support\"\>Getting Support\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168534				0	br	Downloads				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1318380				0	br	The localization projects offer support pages in local languages. Find an overview of the native language projects at \<link href=\"http://projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\"\>projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\</link\>. You can find help and support in English language on the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3028143				0	br	You can download the latest version from the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://download.openoffice.org/\"\>download.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140	4			0	br	Visit \<link href=\"http://www.sun.com/star/support\"\>www.sun.com/star/support\</link\> in the Internet for more information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150667				0	br	You can find help and support on the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://www.openoffice.org\"\>www.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	br	For a summary of the current support services refer to the \<emph\>Readme\</emph\> file in the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> folder.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166335				0	br	Ask about OpenOffice.org, find help by volunteers, and discuss topics on the mailing lists. You can find many general and specialized mailing lists on the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\"\>www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3497211				0	br	You can download documentation as PDF files, how-tos, and guides from the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://documentation.openoffice.org\"\>documentation.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Getting Support				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Icons in the Documentation\"\>Icons in the Documentation\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	br	Icons in the Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	br	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	br	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	br	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	br	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Icons in the Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	br	The \<emph\>$[officename] Help system\</emph\> provides easy access to information and support. There are several ways to find what you are looking for in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>Help environment\</link\>: You can search for a specific keyword in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>, carry out a full-text search under \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, or look through a hierarchical list of the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Topics\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149202				0	br	Navigation Pane				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	br	\<variable id=\"00000110\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window\"\>The \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help Window\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3149294\" src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149294\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	br	Displays the tree structure of the main Help pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_INDEX\"\>Hides and shows the \<emph\>navigation pane\</emph\>\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	2			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HelpOnHelp\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Provides an overview of the Help system\</ahelp\>The Help window shows the currently selected Help page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_PRINT\"\>\<emph\>Prints\</emph\> the current page\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148673				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TABCONTROL\"\>The navigation pane of the Help window contains the tab pages \<emph\>Contents\</emph\>, \<emph\>Index\</emph\>, \<emph\>Find\</emph\> and \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149415				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3159399\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_browseforward.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159399\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3148642\" src=\"res/sc06303.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148642\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3155434\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_print.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155434\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Contents\"\>Contents\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_BACKWARD\"\>Moves back to the \<emph\>previous\</emph\> page\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	br	Contains an index of keywords.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152781				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3149811\" src=\"res/sc06301.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149811\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3155892\" src=\"sfx2/res/indexon_small.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155892\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	br	Allows you to carry out a full-text search. The search will include the entire Help contents of the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_START\"\>Moves to the \<emph\>first page\</emph\> of the current Help topic\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	br	These commands can also be found in the context menu of the Help document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_FORWARD\"\>Moves forward to the \<emph\>next\</emph\> page\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_BOOKMARKS\"\>Adds this page to your bookmarks\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Bookmarks\"\>Bookmarks\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156062				0	br	Contains user-defined bookmarks. You can edit or delete bookmarks, or click them to go to the corresponding pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	br	The Help system describes commercial software from Sun Microsystems, Inc. Due to license restrictions, some of the functions described here may not be included in this particular \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> distribution.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_LISTBOX\"\>The list box located at the very top is where you can select other \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help modules.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Index\</emph\> and \<emph\>Find\</emph\> tab pages only contain the data for the selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOX\"\>The \<emph\>Toolbar\</emph\> contains important functions for controlling the Help system\</ahelp\>:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D9				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id7358623\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recsearch.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7358623\"\>Search icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FE				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_SEARCHDIALOG\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Find on this page\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10906				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:ComboBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the text that you want to search for or select a text entry in the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10922				0	br	Help Page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10926				0	br	You can copy from the Help Viewer to the clipboard on your operating system with standard copy commands. For example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092C				0	br	On a Help page, select the text that you want to copy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10930				0	br	Press Ctrl+C.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10933				0	br	To search the current Help page:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10939				0	br	Click the \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10940				0	br	The \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> dialog opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10993				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WHOLEWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds complete words only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109AA				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_MATCHCASE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distinguishes between uppercase text and lowercase text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C1				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WRAPAROUND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches the entire Help page, starting at the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D8				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_BACKWARDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches backwards from the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109F5				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:PushButton:RID_DLG_SEARCH:PB_FIND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds the next occurrence of the search term.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A22				0	br	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter the text that you want to find.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	br	Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A36				0	br	You can also click in the Help page and press Ctrl+F.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A48				0	br	Select the search options that you want to use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A59				0	br	To find the next occurrence of the search term on the page, click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150672				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>Help; Help tips\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help tips; help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help Agent; help\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	br	The Help Agent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	br	Extended Tips				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	br	Tips				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155599				0	br	\<variable id=\"00000120\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000120.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\"\>Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	br	The Help Agent, Tips, and Extended Tips provide help while you work. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	br	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	br	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	br	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	br	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id5693533				0	br	Enable or disable the Help Agent on \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	br	Enable or disable the tips on \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	br	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore the Help Agent each time you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	br	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149428				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>Index tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; keywords\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	br	\<variable id=\"00000130\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index - Keyword Search in the Help\"\>Index - Keyword Search in the Help\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	br	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	br	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3148668				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_INDEX_PB_OPEN_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to display the selected topic.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_INDEX_CB_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Double-click an entry or type the word you want to find in the index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	br	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Index - Keyword Search in the Help				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148532				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>Find tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; full-text search\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>full-text search in Help\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148523				0	br	\<variable id=\"00000140\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find - The Full-Text Search\"\>Find - The Full-Text Search\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	br	You can enter any combination of search terms, separated by spaces. Searching is \<emph\>not\</emph\> case-sensitive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	br	The \<emph\>Complete words only\</emph\> check box allows you to perform an exact search. If this box is marked, incomplete words will not be found. Do not mark this check box if the search term you enter should also be found as part of a longer word.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	br	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_LB_RESULT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the headings of the pages found in your full-text search. They are sorted according to relevance with the best matches at the top of the list. To display a page, double-click its entry.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3152552				0	br	The full text search function in $[officename] Help allows you to find Help documents that contain any combination of search terms. To do this, type one or more words into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to start a full-text search for the term you entered.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	br	The \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field stores the words you entered last. To repeat a previous search, click the arrow icon and select the term from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_SCOPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to only search in document headings for the search term.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_OPEN_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the entry selected in the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155599				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the search term here. The search is not case-sensitive.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	br	After the search has been carried out, the document headings of the results appear in a list sorted with the best matches at the top. Either double-click an entry, or select it and click \<emph\>Display\</emph\> to load the corresponding Help document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_FULLWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to carry out an exact search for the word you entered. Incomplete words will not be found.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	br	Use the check box \<emph\>Find in headings only\</emph\> to limit the search to document headings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
