helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	br	The settings you select for the export will be automatically saved as a design for other exports. You can enter the design name after clicking \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	br	In this area, you can choose to create a new design and select or delete an existing design.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:LISTBOX:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE1_DESIGNS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays all existing designs.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE1_OLD_DESIGN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Loads an existing design from the design list to use as a starting point for the steps to follow on the next pages of the Wizard.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	br	On the first page you can select an existing design or create a new one.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
