helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150113				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_CHECKBOX1\"\>Converts the entire document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_CHKTEXTDOCUMENTS\"\>Converts currency amounts found in fields and tables of $[officename] Writer documents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OBDIR\"\>Converts all $[officename] Calc and $[officename] Writer documents and templates in the selected directory.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_CHECKRECURSIVE\"\>Specifies whether all subfolders of the selected directory are included.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	br	Select the cells you want to convert in this range, if you did not mark the \<emph\>Entire document\</emph\> check box. Select an option and then click the desired entries in the \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> / \<emph\>Currency ranges\</emph\> field. The selected range will be visible as such in the document. Click \<emph\>Convert\</emph\> to carry out the conversion.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
