helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055C				0	br	The Start-up Wizard opens when you start %PRODUCTNAME for the first time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055F				0	br	The wizard consists of the following pages:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	br	Welcome				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Start-up Wizard helps you to specify the user settings for %PRODUCTNAME. This wizard only runs once.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10575				0	br	License				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read and accept the license text. You need to scroll to the end of the license text before you can continue.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10588				0	br	Migration				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can use this page to import user data from a previously installed version of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059F				0	br	Copy personal data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
