helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B2				0	br	User name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The user name is used for the document properties, templates, and when you record changes made to documents. This page is only displayed if a previous installation of %PRODUCTNAME is not found on your computer.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C8				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter your personal data into the text boxes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
