helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"34266\"\>Opens a dialog where you can specify the location of the archive file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	br	The web via FTP				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"34268\"\>Uploads your files to an FTP server. The index page is saved to the location that you specified. All other files are saved to the "myWebsite" directory in the directory that contains the index page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10584				0	br	You cannot use the FTP option if you connect to the internet through a proxy server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
