helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150445				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02000000.xhp\" name=\"Queries\"\>Queries\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
