helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151120				0	br	In the following example, a query is run through two tables: an "Item" table with the "Item_No" field and a "Suppliers" table with the "Supplier_Name" field. In addition, both tables have a common field name "Supplier_No."				2002-02-02 02:02:02
