helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	br	In design mode, the form is designed and the properties of the form and the controls contained in it are defined.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	br	You will find the sorting and filter functions in the toolbar when you open a form in user mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156136				0	br	Forms can be used to enter or to edit existing database contents easily.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	br	The Form Controls toolbar offers the tools required to create a form in a text, table, drawing, or presentation document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Forms				2002-02-02 02:02:02
