helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	br	Specifies the number of decimal places for a numerical field or decimal field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TABLEDESIGN_INSERTROWS\"\>Inserts an empty row above the current row, if the table has not been saved. Inserts an empty row at the end of the table if the table has been saved.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TABLEDESIGN_TABED_PRIMARYKEY\"\>If this command has a check mark, the data field in this line is a primary key.\</ahelp\> By clicking the command you activate/deactivate the status. The command is only visible if the data source supports primary keys.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150685				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABLE_DESIGN_HELP_WINDOW\"\>Displays help texts.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	br	In the \<emph\>Table Design\</emph\> window you define new tables or edit the structure of a table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
