helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	br	use the structure of the table as the basis for creating a new table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153147				0	br	copy the data from the table into another table,				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535	2			0	br	Dragging-and-dropping a query or table opens the \<emph\>Copy Table \</emph\>dialog, which allows you to define the options for copying a query or a table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628				0	br	You can copy within the same database or between different databases.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
