helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	br	You can only enter administration commands in this dialog, such as Grant, Create Table, or Drop Table, and not filter commands. The commands that you can enter depend on the data source, for example, dBase can only run some of the SQL commands list here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
