helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id393078				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable Include Date to insert a date field into the active area of the report. The date field displays the current date when the report is executed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id4320810				0	br	You can click the date or time field and drag to another position within the same area, or edit the properties in the Properties window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id5992919				0	br	Click OK to insert the field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id6278878				0	br	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift-F1\</item\> and point with the mouse at an input box to see a help text for this input box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id8561052				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a format to display the time.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id8638874				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can open the Date and Time dialog of the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> by choosing \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Date and Time\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_datetime.xhp	0	help	par_id8718832				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable Include Time to insert a time field into the active area of the report. The time field displays the current time when the report is executed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
