helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2356028				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Defines the height of the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2414014				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Print when group change\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2561723				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the background color for the selected object, both on screen and for printing.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2711264				0	br	The Properties window of the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> always shows the properties of the currently selected object in the Report Builder view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3148899				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Force New Page specifies whether the current section and/or the next section is printed on a new page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3587145				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Add Field window is shown automatically when you have selected a table in the Contents box and leave that box. You can also click the Add Field icon on the toolbar, or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Add Field\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3644215				0	br	You can specify some properties to fine-tune the way the records are printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3729361				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To display the Data or General tab page for the whole report, choose Edit - Select Report.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id401623				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies in which context the page footer will be printed: on all pages, or not on pages with a report header or footer\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
