helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7749565				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For a picture, you can specify to either insert the picture as a link to a file or only as an embedded object in the Base file. The embedded option increases the size of the Base file, while the link option is not as portable to other computers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
