helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	br	In Internet Explorer, browse to a web page that contains a link to a $[officename] Writer document, for example.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	br	Click the Start button on the Windows taskbar. Choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	8			0	br	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\> and \<emph\>Install\</emph\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3153821				0	br	Close $[officename] and the Quickstarter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3154072				0	br	You may still right-click the link to save the file on your harddisk.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3154367				0	br	The $[officename] document inside the Internet Explorer shows a set of read-only toolbar icons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155				0	br	In the list, click %PRODUCTNAME, then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3159399				0	br	Open the \<emph\>Optional Components\</emph\> entry and find the \<emph\>ActiveX Control\</emph\> entry. Open the sub menu of the icon and select to install the feature.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	br	Under Windows only, you can view any $[officename] document in a window of the Microsoft Internet Explorer. Install the ActiveX control in the $[officename] Setup program.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	br	In the Control Panel, click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	br	In the Installation Wizard, select \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
