helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id2706991				0	br	If no title text exists, choose \<emph\>Insert - Title\</emph\> to enter the text in a dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	br	A gray border appears around the chart and the menu bar now contains commands for editing the objects in the chart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	br	A single-click on the title allows you to move it with the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	br	Select one of the available tabs in the dialog to make modifications.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	br	Double-click on the default title text. A gray border appears around the text and you can now make changes. Press Enter to create a new line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	br	To edit a chart title that you have inserted into a $[officename] document:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681				0	br	Double-click on the chart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
