helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152801				0	br	\<variable id=\"configure_overview\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/configure_overview.xhp\" name=\"Configuring $[officename]\"\>Configuring $[officename]\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	br	You are free to change the items on the menu bar. You can delete items, add new ones, copy items from one menu to another, rename them, and so on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	br	The toolbars may be freely configured.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	br	You can change the shortcut keys.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	br	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>Tools - Customize\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	br	To change these, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
