helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F9				0	br	\<variable id=\"data_queries\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_queries.xhp\"\>Working with Queries\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	br	If you often want to access only a subset of your data that can be well defined by a filter condition, you can define a query. This is basically a name for the new view at the filtered data. You open the query and see the current data in the table layout that you defined.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
