helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	br	In %PRODUCTNAME you can create a new query using the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/querywizard00.xhp\"\>Query Wizard\</link\>:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
