helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	br	Data from any \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/dabadoc.xhp\"\>database file\</link\> can be registered to %PRODUCTNAME. To register means to tell %PRODUCTNAME where the data is located, how it is organized, how to get that data, and more. Once the database is registered, you can use the menu command \<emph\>View - Data source\</emph\> to access the data records from your text documents and spreadsheets.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C8				0	br	To register an existing database file:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CF				0	br	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01160200.xhp\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Base - Databases\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E1				0	br	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> and select the database file. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F3				0	br	\<embedvar href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/main.xhp#base\"/\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FB				0	br	\<embedvar href=\"text/shared/guide/database_main.xhp#database_main\"/\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN10700				0	br	To remove a registered database from %PRODUCTNAME				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN10707				0	br	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01160200.xhp\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Base - Databases\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	par_idN10719				0	br	Select the database file and click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_register.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Registering and Deleting a Database 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
