helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153104				0	br	Editing a Report				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	br	On the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100500.xhp\" name=\"last dialog page of the Report AutoPilot\"\>last dialog page of the Report Wizard\</link\>, you can choose to edit the report template before you use the report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	br	%PRODUCTNAME stores the templates for reports in a database file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	br	In the database file window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	br	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> and select the database file that you want to create the report for.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431				0	br	You can edit the page styles for the first page and the following pages of the report as well as the paragraph styles, the number formats, the printed field labels, and more.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	br	Double-click one of the report links to open the report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id4747154				0	br	Execute the report to see the resulting report document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id5086825				0	br	Use the toolbars and menu commands and drag-and-drop to edit the report as stated in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id7510910				0	br	Right-click the name of a report in the database file window, then choose Edit.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id8138065				0	br	The Report Builder window opens with the report's information loaded. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	br	These links are added automatically by the Report Wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D7				0	br	Unless you have a thorough understanding of the database the report accesses, do not edit the SQL statement, database name, the hidden form controls, or the related information on the report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Using and Editing Database Reports 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	bm_id3729667				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>databases;creating reports\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>reports;creating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wizards;reports\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
