helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1757560				0	br	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to open the Report Builder window, with the report's information loaded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1886959				0	br	Started by "Use Wizard to Create Report" command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2866908				0	br	You can choose to generate a one-time snapshot with fixed data, or a "live" report with links to the current data at the time when you open the Base file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2891933				0	br	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to create a new report with the current data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id3119602				0	br	Open the database file where you want to create the new report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id408948				0	br	Saves the report and the information how to create the report inside the Base file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4094363				0	br	The following list gives you some information to decide which method to use for your data:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4169743				0	br	Saves the report as a Writer text document. Stores the information how to create the report inside the Base file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4226508				0	br	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id455030				0	br	Full flexibility to use report headers and footers, page headers and footers, multi-column reports.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4649189				0	br	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to edit the Writer template file that was used to create the report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4870754				0	br	Follow the instructions in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5758842				0	br	Click \<emph\>Create Report in Design View\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5931272				0	br	Use drag-and-drop to position the record fields or other design elements like pictures or lines.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id6142765				0	br	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to either see again the static snapshot of the data from first creation time, or to create a new report with the current data. This depends on your choice on the last page of the wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8032166				0	br	Follow the steps of the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100000.xhp\"\>Report Wizard\</link\> to create the report.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8409985				0	br	Uses a Writer template to generate a report document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8514358				0	br	Report Builder				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8611713				0	br	Generates a one-time snapshot of the data. To see an updated report, execute the same report again to create a Writer document with the updated data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
