helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	br	When you save a new file for the first time, the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>Save As\</link\> dialog opens, in which you can enter a name, folder and drive or volume for the file. To open this dialog, choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
