helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	br	Note that the mouse pointer displays a plus sign when copying and an arrow when creating a link or hyperlink.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	br	If you drag objects out of the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/navigator.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>\<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>\</link\>, you can specify in the submenu of the Navigator's \<emph\>Drag Mode\</emph\> icon whether to copy the object, insert it as a link or insert it as a hyperlink.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
