helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166410				0	br	Sending a Fax Through the Print Dialog				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	br	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985				0	br	Select the fax driver from the \<emph\>Fax\</emph\> list box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	br	Open the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog by choosing \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> and select the fax driver in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> list box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	br	You can configure $[officename] so that a single click on an icon automatically sends the current document as a fax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3155135				0	br	Clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> opens the dialog for your fax driver, where you can select the fax recipient.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	br	To send a fax directly from $[officename], you need a fax modem and a fax driver that allows applications to communicate with the fax modem.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EB				0	br	Click the arrow icon at the end of the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar. In the drop-down menu, choose \<emph\>Customize\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	br	The \<emph\>Toolbar\</emph\>s tab page of the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FA				0	br	Click \<emph\>Add Commands\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	br	Select the "Documents" category, then select the "Send Default Fax" command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	br	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> and then \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	br	On the \<emph\>Toolbars\</emph\> tab page, click the down arrow button to position the new icon where you want it. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	br	Your \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar now has a new icon to send the current document as a fax.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
