helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069C				0	br	On the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> toolbar, click the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> icon. \<image id=\"img_id7040009\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fontworkgalleryfloater.png\" width=\"4.32mm\" height=\"4.32mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7040009\"\>Fontwork icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
