helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B2				0	br	Right-click the button and choose \<emph\>Control\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CD				0	br	Specify the properties of the button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
