helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156282				0	br	Inserting an object as a background graphic				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	br	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	br	You can insert an object in a document either as a \<emph\>copy\</emph\> or as a \<emph\>link\</emph\>. A copy of an object is independent of the original object. Changes to the original object have no effect on the copy. A link remains dependent on the original object. Changes to the original object are also reflected in the link.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	br	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	br	Select an object by a single click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147289				0	br	Open the context menu and choose \<emph\>Insert - Background - Page\</emph\> or \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147443				0	br	Drag the object on to the other object in the document while pressing Ctrl.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148617				0	br	Select an object by a single click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
