helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	br	Drag the object into the document, or right-click to open the context menu and select \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and \<emph\>Copy\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140				0	br	Drag the object into the document while pressing the Shift and Ctrl keys, or right-click to open the context menu and select \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and \<emph\>Link\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
