helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id1727347				0	br	All the options of \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer are now available to you. Not all options that \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer offers for editing of documents can be saved in HTML format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
