helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	br	Open the wizard, which guides you through the operation, to copy and convert all documents from Microsoft Word, Microsoft Excel or Microsoft PowerPoint into OpenDocument file format documents. You can select a source and target directory, specify whether to convert documents and/or templates, and more besides.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
