helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	br	When you select the bitmap image, the \<emph\>Picture\</emph\> Bar offers you the tools for editing the image. Only a local copy is edited in the document, even if you have inserted an image as a link.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
