helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3151300				0	br	In the main help pages, use Tab to jump to the next hyperlink or Shift+Tab to jump to the previous link.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152360				0	br	Press F10 to switch to the menu bar and back.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
