helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153958				0	br	Arrow buttons move through the main selection area. Spacebar adds the current character to the list of characters to be inserted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	br	Pressing Ctrl+Enter on an icon for creating a draw object. A draw object will be placed into the middle of the view, with a predefined size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	br	Spacebar: switches from selection of the current row and cancellation of any selection, but not if the current cell is in edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154171				0	br	Ctrl+Shift+Space key: select the range from the last selected column to the current column (does not change other selections)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154320				0	br	In several windows, dialogs, and in the table control field, there are tables to select data, for instance, in the right part of the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/database_main.xhp\" name=\"Data Source View\"\>Data Source View\</link\>. The following keys are used for selections in these tables:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154343				0	br	Use the icon \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> to switch into the point edit mode for polygons and back.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154368				0	br	Ctrl+Shift+E: switches between data source explorer and table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	br	document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154529				0	br	Enter: when a connection is selected, the Enter key opens the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog of the connection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154538				0	br	Home or End: jump to the first or the last possible position				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154647				0	br	Insert key: insert a split (leave existing splits unchanged)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154650				0	br	Shift+Delete: delete all splits				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154733				0	br	Shift+Space key: select the range from the last selected column to the current column				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	br	Delete key: delete a split				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154912				0	br	Press Backspace above the Enter key to return to the previous help page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
