helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155148				0	br	Left Arrow or Right Arrow: select left or right column and clear other selections				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	br	Use the down arrow or Page Down key to scroll down the combo box entries, or the up arrow or Page Up key to scroll upwards. The Home key takes you to the first entry and the End key takes you to the last entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
