helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\lineend_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3149765				0	br	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> and assign a name to the new arrow style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\lineend_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3149795				0	br	Select the object and choose \<emph\>Format - Object - Line\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
