helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\lineend_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	br	You can define any object to be included in the list of available line ends.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\lineend_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3154306				0	br	In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Arrow Styles\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
