helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	br	Enter a name for the line style and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202				0	br	To save the line style in a custom line style list, click the \<emph\>Save Line Styles\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	br	To specify the length of the line as a percentage of the line width, select \<emph\>Fit to line width\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
