helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	br	Select a line drawing object in a document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419	14			0	br	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Object - Line\</item\> and click the \<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
