helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986				0	br	The \<emph\>Document Converter Wizard\</emph\> will copy and convert all Microsoft Office files in a folder into $[officename] documents in the OpenDocument file format. You can specify the folder to be read, and the folder where the converted files are to be saved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	br	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>. Select a Microsoft Office file in the $[officename] file open dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
