helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	br	Printing in black and white in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Impress and \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148920				0	br	Printing the current text document with black and white text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150125				0	br	\<variable id=\"print_blackwhite\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/print_blackwhite.xhp\" name=\"Printing in Black and White\"\>Printing in Black and White\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150358				0	br	Printing all text documents with black and white text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150499				0	br	Printing text and graphics in black and white				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	br	Printing only text in black and white				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	br	All text documents or HTML documents will be printed with black text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	br	Select the option to print in black and white. For further information, refer to the user's manual of your printer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610	16			0	br	\<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> converts all colors into the two values black and white. All borders around objects are printed black. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	br	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	br	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer you can choose to print color-formatted text in black and white. You can specify this either for all subsequent text documents to be printed, or only for the current printing process.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	br	Under \<emph\>Quality,\</emph\> select either \<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> or \<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Impress \</emph\>or \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Draw\</emph\>, as appropriate.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	br	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560	26			0	br	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button. This opens the \<emph\>Printer Options\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	br	Under \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149786	15			0	br	\<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> converts all colors to a maximum of 256 gradations from black to white. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	br	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Writer \</emph\>or \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Writer/Web\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	br	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	br	Confirm the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\" name=\"Printing dialogs\"\>Printing dialogs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154146				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options dialog\"\>Tools - Options dialog\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	br	When either of these options is selected, all presentations or drawings will be printed without color. If you only want to print in black for the \<emph\>current\</emph\> print job, select the option in \<emph\>File - Print - Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910	22			0	br	Under \<emph\>Contents,\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3155308	28			0	br	The text document or HTML document now being printed will be printed in black text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	br	Click on \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>. This opens the Properties dialog for your printer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	br	The current document will be printed in black and white.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Printing in Black and White				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	bm_id5201574				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>gradients off for faster printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bitmaps;off for faster printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resolution when printing bitmaps \</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>transparency;off for faster printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>reduced printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>speed of printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing speed\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing;transparencies\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing;faster\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>faster printing\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	br	\<variable id=\"print_faster\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/print_faster.xhp\"\>Printing faster with Reduced Data\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C8				0	br	You can decide to reduce the data necessary to print your document. The settings can be defined differently for printing directly to the printer or for printing to a file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CE				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D6				0	br	Click one of the following settings options: 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D9				0	br	\<emph\>Printer\</emph\>\<emph\>- \</emph\>to define options for reducing data while printing directly to a printer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	br	\<emph\>Print to file\</emph\>\<emph\>-\</emph\> to define options for reducing data while printing to a file				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	br	Select any combination of the four options, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	br	All documents that you print from now on will use the changed options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F3				0	br	Print your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	br	You can reduce data for transparency, for gradients, or for bitmaps. When you reduce the data, on many printers you will not see a reduction of printing quality. But the printing time is substantially shorter, and when you print to a file, the file size is much smaller.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN10704				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010900.xhp\"\>Print options\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Printing with Reduced Data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
