helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145121				0	br	Choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\> and mark the \<emph\>Save with password\</emph\> check box. Save the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
