helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A74				0	br	Selecting the option button sets the scope of the new key combination to be applicable in all of %PRODUCTNAME or only in documents of the current module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
