helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145				0	br	Double-click the white area of the ruler to set one tab. The \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> dialog appears with the \<emph\>Tabs\</emph\> tab page open.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
