helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	br	Click the ruler once to set a left-justified tab. Right-click a tab icon on the ruler to see the context menu in which you can change the tab type.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156				0	br	To move several tab stops on the ruler, press the Shift key before you click a tab. Drag one tab while continuing to press Shift to move that tab as well as all the tabs to the right of it. The spacing between those tabs remains the same.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id5199133				0	br	Change the tab stops for one or more paragraphs: Select the paragraphs, then click inside the ruler.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
