helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	br	When you start a dialog to open or save a document, $[officename] initially displays your work directory. To change this directory:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - Paths\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	br	In the \<emph\>Select Path\</emph\> dialog, choose the work directory you want and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
