helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	br	You also use this procedure to change the directory displayed by $[officename] when you want to insert a graphic. Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - Paths - Graphics\</emph\>, then follow step 3.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802	5			0	br	Click \<emph\>My Documents \</emph\>and click the\<emph\> Edit button, or \</emph\>double-click on \<emph\>My Documents\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
