helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3148817				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteRecord\"\>Deletes a record. A query needs to be confirmed before deleting.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3148914				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NextRecord\"\>Takes you to the next record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3149735				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3155578\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_newrecord.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155578\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	br	If an SQL statement is the basis for a form (see \<emph\>Form Properties\</emph\> - tab \<emph\>Data\</emph\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Data Source\"\>\<emph\>Data Source\</emph\>\</link\>), then the filter and sort functions are only available when the SQL statement refers to only one table and is not written in the native SQL mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3150647				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3150941\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recsave.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150941\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:LastRecord\"\>Takes you to the last record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3151276				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RecUndo\"\>Allows you to undo a data entry.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	br	The current sort order or filter is saved with the current document. If a filter is set, the \<emph\>Apply Filter\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> bar is activated. Sorting and filtering features in the document can also be configured in the \<emph\>Form Properties\</emph\> dialog. (Choose \<emph\>Form Properties - Data\</emph\> - properties \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Sort\"\>\<emph\>Sort\</emph\>\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Filter\"\>\<emph\>Filter\</emph\>\</link\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	br	You can control the view of data with the sorting and filtering functions. Original tables are not changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3150010\" src=\"res/sc10616.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150010\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	br	The \<emph\>Form Navigation\</emph\> bar contains icons to edit a database table or to control the data view. The bar is displayed at the bottom of a document that contains fields that are linked to a database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3155308				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FirstRecord\"\>Takes you to the first record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3155337				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3163808\" src=\"res/sc10619.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3163808\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3157846				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrevRecord\"\>Takes you to the previous record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3157910				0	br	The Navigation bar is only visible for forms connected to a database. In the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Design view\"\>Design view\</link\> of a form, the Navigation bar is not available. See also \<link href=\"text/shared/main0212.xhp\" name=\"Database Bar\"\>Table Data bar\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	br	You can use the \<emph\>Form Navigation\</emph\> bar to move within records as well as to insert and to delete records. If data is saved in a form, the changes are transferred to the database. The \<emph\>Form Navigation\</emph\> bar also contains sort, filter, and search functions for data records.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3166423				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3156138\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recundo.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156138\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_idN10717				0	br	You can use the Navigation bar icon on the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\"\>More Controls \</link\> bar to add a Navigation bar to a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
