helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969	34			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_COLOR:NUM_LUMINANCE\"\>Sets the Brightness in the HSB color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
