helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944	5			0	br	In the right color window, you will see the entire color spectrum from the left to the right, with the colors at the top being fully saturated and the colors at the bottom being unsaturated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3149298	26			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_COLOR:NUM_GREEN\"\>Sets the Green color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670	6			0	br	In the left color window, you will see a selection of colors, displaying a progressive spectrum, varying between the four colors in the four corners of this window. You can change the colors in the four corners as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398	8			0	br	In the right color window, click the desired new color for the corner field or enter the values, which define the color, in the numeric input fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"farbentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to define your own colors using the two-dimensional graphic and numerical gradient chart.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to display the newly defined color in the preview box of the \<emph\>Colors\</emph\> register, where you can then decide if you want to add or replace the new color in the current color palette.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043	14			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_COLOR:BTN_2\"\>Sets the small selection cursor in the right window on the color, which corresponds to the selected color in the left window and updates the respective values in the numerical fields.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210	9			0	br	Accept the color selected on the right into the small field that is marked in the left color window by clicking the \<emph\><--\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383	10			0	br	The gradient in the left color window is immediately adjusted with respect to hue, saturation, and brightness.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596	18			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_METRICFIELD_DLG_COLOR_NUM_MAGENTA\"\>Sets the Magenta color value in the CMYK color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061	4			0	br	In the two big color windows, you click to select a new color. You can select the color in the left or the right color window as you wish.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3153512	32			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_COLOR:NUM_SATURATION\"\>Sets the Saturation in the HSB color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726	24			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_COLOR:NUM_RED\"\>Sets the Red color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154164	35			0	br	In the left preview field, you will see the original color from the parent tab, \<emph\>Colors\</emph\>. In the right preview field, you will always see the current result of your work in this dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729	30			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_COLOR:NUM_HUE\"\>Sets the Hue in the HSB color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758	7			0	br	Click the corner of the field in which you want to change the color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909	12			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_COLOR:BTN_1\"\>Click the <-- button to replace the selected color in the color palette with the color selected at the right.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306	20			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_METRICFIELD_DLG_COLOR_NUM_YELLOW\"\>Sets the Yellow color value in the CMYK color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252	16			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS_METRICFIELD_DLG_COLOR_NUM_CYAN\"\>Sets the Cyan color value in the CMYK color model.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
