helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	bm_id2322153				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>macros;selecting security warnings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>security;options for documents with macros\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>saving;with password by default\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>user data;removing when saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>file sharing options for current document\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>macros;security\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>read-only documents;opening documents as\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147588				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01030300.xhp\" name=\"Security\"\>Security\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_TABPAGE_RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SCRIPTING\"\>Defines the security options for saving documents and for opening documents that contain macros.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10640				0	br	Security options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10644				0	br	Warns if document contains recorded changes, versions, hidden information, or notes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10647				0	br	When saving or sending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988739\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to save or send a document that contains recorded changes, versions, or notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064E				0	br	When printing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10652				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988740\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to print a document that contains recorded changes or notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	br	When signing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10659				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988741\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to sign a document that contains recorded changes, versions, fields, references to other sources (for example linked sections or linked pictures), or notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065C				0	br	When creating PDF files				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988742\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to export a document to PDF format that displays recorded changes in Writer, or that displays notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	br	Remove personal information on saving				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988743\"\>Select to always remove user data from the file properties. If this option is not selected, you can still remove the personal information for the current document with the \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> button on \<emph\>File - Properties - General\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	br	Recommend password protection on saving				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10680				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988744\"\>Select to specify that the \<emph\>Save with password\</emph\> option in the file saves dialogs checked by default. Deselect the option to save a file without password.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10687				0	br	Macro security				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068B				0	br	Adjust the security level for executing macros and specify trusted macro authors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068E				0	br	Macro Security				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10692				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703992332\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Macro Security\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A3				0	br	File sharing options for this document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A7				0	br	The following options are valid only for the current document:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	br	Open this document in read-only mode				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AE				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988750\"\>Select to allow this document to be opened in read-only mode only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B1				0	br	This file sharing option protects the document against accidental changes. It is still possible to edit a copy of the document and save that copy with the same name as the original.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B4				0	br	Record changes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703988751\"\>Select to enable recording changes. This is the same as \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	br	To protect the recording state with a password, click \<emph\>Protect\</emph\> and enter a password. Other users of this document can apply their changes, but they cannot disable change recording without the password.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D0				0	br	Protect / Unprotect				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D4				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"703992336\"\>Protects the change recording state with a password. If change recording is protected for the current document, the button is named \<emph\>Unprotect\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Unprotect\</emph\> and type the correct password to disable the protection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Security				2002-02-02 02:02:02
