helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153821				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01030500.xhp\" name=\"HTML compatibility\"\>HTML compatibility\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
