helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154920				0	br	Defines which document elements are displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	br	You can also control the display of graphics through the \<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18120000.xhp\" name=\"Graphics\"\>\<emph\>Graphics On/Off\</emph\>\</link\> icon. If a text document is open, this icon is displayed on the \<emph\>Tools\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	br	Specifies whether scrollbars and rulers are displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_CONTENT_OPT:CB_FIELD\"\>Displays the field names in the document instead of the contents of the fields.\</ahelp\> You can also choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"View - Fields\"\>\<emph\>View - Fields\</emph\>\</link\> in a text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
