helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149786				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_STD_FONT\"\>Specifies the settings for the basic fonts in your documents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
