helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155938				0	br	Insert				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	br	Specifies the default settings for columns and rows and the table mode. Also specifies the standard values for moving and inserting columns and rows. For further information see \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090201.xhp\" name=\"Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\"\>Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\> in the $[officename] Writer Help\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTTABLE_PAGE\"\>Defines the attributes of tables in text documents.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_BORDER\"\>Specifies that table cells have a border by default.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792				0	br	Direct formatting is not influenced by the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> field. If you center align the cell contents directly, they remain centered irrespective of whether text or numbers are involved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147128				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:RB_FIXPROP\"\>Specifies that changes to a row or column have an effect on the entire table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	br	Defines the defaults for all newly created text tables in text documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149204				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_REPEAT_HEADER\"\>Specifies whether the table heading is carried over onto the new page after a page break.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMALIGNMENT\"\>Specifies that numbers are always bottom right aligned in the cell.\</ahelp\> If this field is not marked numbers are always top left aligned in the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFORMATTING\"\>Specifies that numbers in a text table are recognized and formatted as numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150298				0	br	Determines the relative effect of rows and columns to adjacent other rows or columns, as well as to the entire table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_HEADER\"\>Specifies that the first row of the table is formatted with the "Table heading" Paragraph Style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151213				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:RB_FIX\"\>Specifies that changes to a row or column only affect corresponding adjacent area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153711	4			0	br	Defines the default settings for moving rows and columns with the keyboard. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153966				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:MF_ROWINSERT\"\>Specifies the default value for inserting rows.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155176	10			0	br	Specifies the default settings for inserting rows and columns with the keyboard. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	br	If \<emph\>Number recognition\</emph\> is not marked, numbers are saved in text format and are automatically left-aligned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_DONT_SPLIT\"\>Specifies that tables are not split by any type of text flow break.\</ahelp\> You can also find this option in menu \<emph\>Table - Table Properties - Text Flow\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155905				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:MF_COLMOVE\"\>Specifies the value to be used for moving a column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159264				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:MF_ROWMOVE\"\>Specifies the value to be used for moving a row.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159334				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:MF_COLINSERT\"\>Specifies the default value for inserting columns.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159346	43			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFMT_FORMATTING\"\>If\<emph\> Number format recognition \</emph\>is not marked, only input in the format that has been set at the cell is accepted. Any other input resets the format to \<emph\>Text\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3166423				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE:RB_VAR\"\>Specifies that changes to a row or column affect the table size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
