helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156180				0	br	Direct cursor (not for HTML documents)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159154				0	br	Breaks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
