helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153823				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040700.xhp\" name=\"Changes\"\>Changes\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	br	Text display				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163713				0	br	Color				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	br	Defines the settings for displaying recorded changes. Select the type of change with the radio buttons, and the corresponding display attribute and color. The preview field shows the effect of the selected display options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_COL\"\>It is possible to select a color to identify each type of recorded change. By entering "By author" from the list, the color is automatically determined by $[officename] and modified according to the corresponding author of the changes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_LC_COL\"\>Specifies the color for highlighting the changed lines in the text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINE_OPT\"\>Defines the appearance of changes in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	br	To indicate which lines of the text have been changed, you can define a mark that appears in the left or right page margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_ATTR\"\>Defines how changes to text attributes are displayed in the document. These changes affect attributes such as bold, italic or underline.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_DEL_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is deleted. If you record text deletions, the text is displayed with the selected attribute (for example, strikethrough) and is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_MARKPOS\"\>Defines if and where changed lines in the document are marked.\</ahelp\> You can set the markings so that they always appear on the left or right page margin, or on even or uneven pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_INS_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is inserted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156153				0	br	To record or show changes, with the text or spreadsheet document open, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Changes\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Changes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
