helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242	57			0	br	\<emph\>Example\</emph\>: Cell E5 contains the text "Europe". Below, in cell E6, is the value 100 and in cell E7 the value 200. If the \<emph\>Automatically find column and row labels\</emph\> box is marked, you can write the following formula in cell A1: =SUM(Europe).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
