helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149413	20			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTIONS_MISC:CBX_MARKED_HIT_MOVES_ALWAYS\"\>Specifies that you want to move an object with the \<emph\>Rotate\</emph\> tool enabled. If\<emph\> Object always moveable \</emph\>is not marked, the \<emph\>Rotate\</emph\> tool can only be used to rotate an object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
