helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	br	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>In a presentation or drawing document, you can also activate the text editing mode through the\<emph\> Allow Quick Editing \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13180000.xhp\" name=\"icon\"\>icon\</link\> in the \<emph\>Option\</emph\> bar.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
