helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730	18			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTIONS_MISC:CBX_COPY\"\>Specifies whether to automatically create a copy when you move an object while holding down the Ctrl key.\</ahelp\> The same will apply for rotating and resizing the object. The original object will remain in its current position and size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
