helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057C				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Lists the trusted certificates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10591				0	br	View				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the View Certificate dialog for the selected certificate.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A6				0	br	Remove				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AA				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Removes the selected certificate from the list of trusted certificates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AD				0	br	Trusted file locations				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B1				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Trusted file locations are used only if the security level is set to "very high". With this setting, document macros are only executed if they have been opened from one of the following locations.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B4				0	br	Add				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B8				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens a folder selection dialog. Select a folder from which all macros are allowed to execute.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BB				0	br	Remove				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_ts.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BF				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Removes the selected folder from the list of trusted file locations.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
