helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id1743522				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>A check will be performed now.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id209051				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>A check will be performed once a month.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id2143925				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to show a dialog box where you can select another folder.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3031098				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>A check will be performed once a day.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3061311				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the selected folder for downloaded files.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4057130				0	br	Online Update is a module that can be selected or deselected to be installed. Choose the customized installation in the Setup of %PRODUCTNAME. When you update an older version using a patch, the Online Update feature is installed automatically with default settings (except for the Solaris version).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id476699				0	br	If you disable the check, the icon is removed from the menu bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id7523728				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to check for online updates periodically, then select the time interval how often %PRODUCTNAME will check for online updates.\</ahelp\> %PRODUCTNAME will check once a day, week, or month, as soon as a working Internet connection is detected. If you connect to the Internet by a proxy server, set the proxy on \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - Internet - Proxy\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id7824030				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>A check will be performed once a week. This is the default setting.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id7870113				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to download an available online update automatically to the specified folder.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8754844				0	br	Specifies some options for the automatic notification and downloading of online updates to %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8994109				0	br	When an update is available, an icon in the menu bar displays an extended bubble help with some explaining text. Click the icon to proceed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Online Update				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053E				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/serverauthentication.xhp\"\>Server Authentication\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN1054E				0	br	On the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/mailmerge.xhp\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Mail Merge E-mail\</link\> tab page, click the \<emph\>Server Authentication\</emph\> button to specify the server security settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN10563				0	br	The outgoing mail server (SMTP) requires authentication				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BE				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enables the authentication that is required to send e-mail by SMTP.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CD				0	br	The outgoing mail server (SMTP) requires separate authentication				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D2				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select if your SMTP server requires a user name and password.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E5				0	br	User name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\serverauthentication.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EA				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the user name for the SMTP server.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
