helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\testaccount.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	br	When you enter settings on the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/mailmerge.xhp\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Mail Merge E-mail\</link\> tab page, you can click the \<emph\>Test Settings\</emph\> button to test your settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
