helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\testaccount.xhp	0	help	par_idN10593				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>In the Errors list box you can read an explanation of any errors encountered while testing the settings.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
