helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148569	88			0	br	The \<emph\>AutoVertical \</emph\>and \<emph\>AutoHorizontal \</emph\>checkboxes must be cleared before you can assign the \<emph\>Text position\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
