helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149876				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:METRICFIELD:RID_SVXPAGE_MEASURE:MTR_FLD_HELPLINE2_LEN\"\>Specifies the length of the right guide starting at the dimension line. Positive values extend the guide below the dimension line and negative values extend the guide above the dimension line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
