helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150475				0	br	Anything you write with the pen is not saved when you exit the slide show. The color of the pen cannot be changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:LISTBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:LB_CUSTOMSHOW\"\>Runs a custom slide show in the order that you defined in \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06100000.xhp\" name=\"Slide Show - Custom Slide Show\"\>\<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Slide Show\</emph\>\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150665				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:CBX_PEN\"\>Changes the mouse pointer to a pen which you can use to draw on slides during the presentation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150764				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:CBX_ALWAYS_ON_TOP\"\>The $[officename] window remains on top during the presentation. No other program will show its window in front of your presentation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:TIMEFIELD:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:TMF_PAUSE\"\>Enter the duration of the pause before the slide show is repeated. If you enter zero, the show restarts immediately without showing a pause slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:CBX_AUTOLOGO\"\>Displays the $[officename] logo on the pause slide.\</ahelp\> The logo cannot be exchanged.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766				0	br	Specifies which slides to include in the slide show.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
