helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153713				0	br	The following options are required to convert a bitmap image to a polygon. The converted image is actually a collection of smaller polygons filled with color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917				0	br	Preview of the original image.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
