helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159207				0	br	Displays the conversion progress.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:METRICFIELD:DLG_VECTORIZE:MT_REDUCE\"\>Removes color polygons that are smaller than the pixel value you enter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
