helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3DLatheFast\"\>Creates a three-dimensional shape by rotating the selected object around its vertical axis.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
