helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147434				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050600.xhp\" name=\"To metafile\"\>To metafile\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147344	3			0	br	You can also copy the selected object and choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special \</emph\>and select MetaFile from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
