helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726	3			0	br	You cannot apply a fill to closed shapes that have been broken apart with this command. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Break\"\>Breaks apart lines joined with the \<emph\>Connect\</emph\> command.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
