helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147516				0	br	Drag the white handle to change the direction of the transparency gradient. Drag the black handle to change the length of the gradient. You can also drag and drop colors onto the handles from the \<emph\>Color\</emph\> Bar to change their grayscale values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148400				0	br	Gradient				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148489				0	br	Rotates or skews the selected 2D object(s) around a pivot point. Drag a corner handle of the object in the direction you want to rotate it. To skew an object, drag a center handle in the direction you want to skew it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018	4			0	br	To open the\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw \<emph\>Mode \</emph\>toolbar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Effects \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. In %PRODUCTNAME Impress, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Mode\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
