helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	br	Each slide has only one pivot point. Double-click an object to move the pivot point to the center of the object. You can also drag the pivot point to a new location on the screen, and then rotate the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
