helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145164				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Square\"\>Draws a filled square where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the square, and drag to the size you want. To draw a rectangle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
