helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148407				0	br	If you want the dimension line to be the same length as the side of a nearby object, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key while dragging. To constrain the dimension line to 45 degrees, hold down the Shift key while dragging.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
