helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3148487				0	br	You can use the keypad to quickly enlarge or reduce the view on your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3148837				0	br	To zoom out, press the Minus Sign.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3149501				0	br	To zoom in, press the Plus Sign.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id7954954				0	br	If you are using a mouse with a scroll wheel, you can hold down Ctrl and turn the wheel to change the zoom factor in all main modules of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
