helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610				0	br	You can use the keyboard to access $[officename] Impress commands as well as to navigate through the workspace. $[officename] Impress uses the same shortcut keys as $[officename] Draw to create \<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"drawing objects\"\>drawing objects\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
