helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149872				0	br	Drag a control point. The curve pulls in the direction that you drag the control point.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149941	60			0	br	Select a data point, and then click the \<emph\>Split Curve \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> Bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
