helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\select_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3150213				0	br	To select an object that is covered by another object using the keyboard, press Tab to cycle through the objects on the slide. To cycle through the objects in reverse order, press Shift+Tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\select_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159238				0	br	To select an object that is covered by other objects, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click through the objects until you reach the underlying object. To cycle through the objects in reverse order, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift when you click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
