helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	br	To resize the spreadsheet without resizing the cells, double-click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle. To resize the cells of the spreadsheet, click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
