helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153191				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>rulers; in presentations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>origin of rulers\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153191				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/main0209.xhp\" name=\"Rulers\"\>Rulers\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3148609				0	br	To specify the measurement units for a ruler, right-click the ruler, and then choose a new unit from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129				0	br	To change the origin (0 point) of the rulers, drag the intersection of the two rulers in the top left corner into the workspace. Vertical and horizontal guides appear. Continue to drag until the vertical and horizontal guides are where you want the new origin to be, and then release. To reset the origins of the rulers to the default values, double-click the intersection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	br	You can use vertical and horizontal rulers at the left and upper edges of the $[officename] Impress workspace to assist you in creating your slide. The sections of the rulers that cover the area of the slide are white.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3150206				0	br	When you select a text object on a slide, indents and tabs are displayed on the horizontal ruler. To change the indent or tab settings for the text object, drag an indent or a tab marker to a new location on the ruler.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3150253				0	br	You can also drag a \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"snap line\"\>snap line\</link\> from a ruler to help you align objects on your slide. To insert a snap line using a ruler, drag the edge of a ruler into the slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3153820	3			0	br	To show or hide the rulers, choose \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/03060000.xhp\" name=\"View - Rulers\"\>\<emph\>View - Rulers\</emph\>\</link\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	br	When you select an object, its dimensions are displayed on the rulers as gray double lines. To precisely resize the object, drag one of the double lines to a new location on the ruler.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	br	To change the slide margins, drag the edge of the white areas in the rulers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Rulers				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145350				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06070000.xhp\" name=\"Interaction\"\>Interaction\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150342				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/main0210.xhp\" name=\"Drawing Bar\"\>Drawing Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153078				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10030000.xhp\" name=\"Rotate\"\>Rotate\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155962				0	br	Select				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	br	To select an object on the current slide, click the \<emph\>Select\</emph\> tool (white arrow) on the Drawing bar, and then click the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610				0	br	To select more than one object, hold down Shift while you click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	br	To select an object that is behind another object, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click the object. To select the next underlying object in the stacking, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click again. To return the selection to the previously selected object, hold down Shift + \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3150202				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"RID_DRAW_TOOLBOX\"\>The \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar contains frequently used editing tools. Click the arrow next to an icon to open a toolbar that contains additional commands.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	br	To remove a selection, click anywhere outside the selected object, or press Escape.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154556				0	br	This tool is used to rotate the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	br	To add text to a selected object, double-click the object and type or enter your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10060000.xhp\"\>Rectangle\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C0				0	br	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10070000.xhp\"\>Ellipse\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	br	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	br	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10050000.xhp\"\>Text\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FA				0	br	Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN10770				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Points\"\>Points\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	br	Enables you to edit points on your drawing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
