helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147338				0	br	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom Out\"\>Zoom Out\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_ZOOMOUT\"\>Decreases the display scale of formulas by 25%.\</ahelp\> The zoom scale is displayed on the status bar. You can also change the scale in the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> of the status bar. The workspace context menu also has zoom options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
