helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152947				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XEQY\"\>Inserts an equal sign (=) with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also directly type \<emph\><?> = <?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
