helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3145263	76			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ALEPH\"\>Use this icon to insert a \<emph\>cardinal number\</emph\>. \</ahelp\> You can achieve the same result by entering \<emph\>aleph\</emph\> in the Commands window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
