helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3147460				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XSUBSETEQY\"\>Use this icon to insert the \<emph\>is a subset or equal to\</emph\> set operator with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also enter \<emph\><?>subseteq<?>\</emph\> in the Commands window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
