helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149290				0	br	After clicking the \<emph\>Set Operations\</emph\> icon in the Selection window additional icons will be shown in the lower part of this window. Simply click a symbol to incorporate the operator in the formula being edited in the Commands window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149338	52			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XOWNSY\"\>Use this icon to insert the set operator \<emph\>includes \</emph\>with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also enter \<emph\><?> owns <?>\</emph\> or \<emph\><?> ni <?>\</emph\> directly in the Commands window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
