helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149549				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XSLASHY\"\>Use this icon to insert a slash for creating a \<emph\>quotient set\</emph\> with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> Enter \<emph\><?>slash<?>\</emph\> in the Commands window, to achieve the same result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149628				0	br	Set of whole numbers				2002-02-02 02:02:02
