helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149995	48			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XNSUPSETY\"\>Use this icon to insert the \<emph\>not superset\</emph\> set operator with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also enter \<emph\><?>nsupset<?> \</emph\>in the Commands window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
