helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091501.xhp	0	help	par_id3149241				0	br	Backslash \\ between two characters, of which the right is superscript, the left subscript				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091501.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	br	Binary operator. A user-defined symbol follows, which is used as a binary operator.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
