helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148839				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_CHECKBOX_RID_FONTDIALOG_1\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Check this box to assign the bold attribute to the font.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_CHECKBOX_RID_FONTDIALOG_2\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Check this box to assign the italic attribute to the font.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208				0	br	You can assign additional attributes to the selected font.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	br	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"STARMATH_MODALDIALOG_RID_FONTDIALOG\"\>Use this dialog to select the font for the respective category in the \<emph\>Fonts\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153713				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_FONTDIALOG_1\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Select a font from the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	br	You can see a preview of the selected font with its attributes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
