helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143228				0	br	Use the \<emph\>Category\</emph\> button to determine the formula element for which you would like to specify the spacing. The appearance of the dialog depends on the selected category. A preview window shows you which spacing is modified through the respective boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145211				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FRACLINE_EXCWIDTH\"\>Determines the excess length of the fraction line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LINE_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between lines.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146323				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_DEFAULT_DIST\"\>Defines the spacing between variables and operators.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_INTERATTRIBUT_DIST\"\>Determines the minimum distance between a symbol and variable.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147509				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LOWERLIMIT_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between the sum symbol and the lower limit.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_BRACKET_EXCHEIGHT2\"\>Adjusts the percentage excess size.\</ahelp\> At 0 percent the brackets are set so that they surround the argument at the same height. The higher the entered value is, the larger the vertical gap between the contents of the brackets and the external border of the brackets. The field can only be used in combination with \<emph\>Scale all brackets\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148746				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LOWERBORDER_DIST\"\>The bottom border is positioned between the formula and background.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_SUB_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing for subscript indexes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_UPPERBORDER_DIST\"\>The top border is positioned between the formula and background.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149102				0	br	Adds a border to your formula. This option is particularly useful if you want to integrate the formula into a text file in $[officename] Writer. When making settings, be sure that you do not use 0 as a size, since this creates viewing problems for text that surrounds the insertion point.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149690				0	br	Defines the spacing of symbols in relation to variables				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149711				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_DENOMINATOR_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between the fraction bar and the denominator.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149755				0	br	Defines the spacing between the sum symbol and the limit conditions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LEFTBORDER_DIST\"\>The left border is positioned between the formula and background.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_BRACKET_DIST\"\>Determines the horizontal distance between the contents and the upper end of the brackets.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149873				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:MENUBUTTON:RID_DISTANCEDIALOG:1\"\>This button allows you to select the category for which you would like to change the spacing.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149885				0	br	Defines the spacing for superscript and subscript indexes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_MATRIXCOL_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between matrix elements in a column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150568				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_SUP_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing for superscript indexes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150764				0	br	Defines the excess length and line weight of the fraction bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150864				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ROOT_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between the root sign and radicals.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151250				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_OPERATOR_DIST\"\>Determines the horizontal distance between operators and variables.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151319				0	br	Defines the relative spacing for the elements in a matrix.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151333				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_OPERATOR_EXCHEIGHT\"\>Determines the height from the variable to the operator's upper edge.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151389				0	br	Defines the spacing between variables and operators, between lines, and between root signs and radicals.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153148				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FRACLINE_LINEWIDTH\"\>Determines the weight of the fraction line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153775				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_MATRIXROW_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between matrix elements in a row.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	br	\<variable id=\"abstaendetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_DISTANCE\"\>Use this dialog to determine the spacing between formula elements. The spacing is specified as a percentage in relation to the base size defined under \<emph\>Format - Font Size\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154106				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_BRACKET_EXCHEIGHT\"\>Determines the vertical distance between the upper edge of the contents and the upper end of the brackets.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154198				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ATTRIBUT_DIST\"\>Defines the height of the symbols in relation to the baseline.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154273				0	br	Defines the spacing between brackets and the content.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154690				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_UPPERLIMIT_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between the sum symbol and the upper limit.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154799				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:CHECKBOX:RID_DISTANCEDIALOG:1\"\>Scales all types of brackets.\</ahelp\> If you then enter \<emph\>( a over b)\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window, the brackets will surround the whole height of the argument. You normally achieve this effect by entering \<emph\>left ( a over b right )\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154898				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_RIGHTBORDER_DIST\"\>The right border is positioned between the formula and background.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155143				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_DEFINE_CUSTOMSHOW:BTN_ADD\"\>Saves your changes as your default settings for all new formulas.\</ahelp\> A security response will appear before saving these changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155181				0	br	Defines the spacing between operators and variables or numbers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155369				0	br	Defines the spacing between the fraction bar and the numerator or denominator.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
