helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154659	1			0	br	Import formula				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150251	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"formelimportierentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_INSERT_FORMULA\" visibility=\"visible\"\>This command opens a dialog for importing a formula.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916	3			0	br	The \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> dialog is set up like the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>Open\</link\> dialog under \<emph\>File\</emph\>. Use the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> dialog to load, edit and display a formula saved as a file in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Import formula				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149500				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>formula cursor in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cursor; in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
