helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146966	15			0	br	Double-clicking a character or symbol in the document moves the focus of the cursor to the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window and highlights its respective position. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
