helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148840				0	br	Use a Wizard to create interactive documents, such as professional letters and faxes, into which you can insert your saved formulas.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959				0	br	This menu contains the general commands for working with formula documents, such as open, save and print.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
