helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150206	4			0	br	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/06020000.xhp\" name=\"Import Formula\"\>Import Formula\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959	2			0	br	Use this menu to open and edit the symbol catalog, or import an external formula as a data file. The program interface can be adjusted to meet your requirements. You can also change the program options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Tools				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155066				0	br	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0107.xhp\" name=\"Window\"\>Window\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0107.xhp	0	help	par_id3147339				0	br	In the Window menu, you can open a new window and see the document list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0107.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Window				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149121				0	br	\<variable id=\"main0200\"\>\<link href=\"text/smath/main0200.xhp\" name=\"Toolbars\"\>Toolbars\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	br	The default toolbars available when working with an activated formula document in $[officename] Math are described here. You can customize the toolbars to meet your requirements by moving, deleting or adding new icons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Toolbars				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150749				0	br	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0202.xhp\" name=\"Status Bar\"\>Status Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id3083278				0	br	The status bar displays information about the active document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Status Bar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149123				0	br	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0203.xhp\" name=\"Tools Bar\"\>Tools Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
