helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0203.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	br	The Tools bar contains frequently used functions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0203.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Tools Bar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
