helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145587				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX5\"\>Moves the selected heading, and the text below the heading, up one heading position in the Navigator and in the document. To move only the selected heading and not the text associated with the heading, hold down Ctrl, and then click this icon.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX8\"\>Switches between the display of all categories in the Navigator and the selected category.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
