helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150954				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_DRAG_HYP\"\>Creates a hyperlink when you drag and drop an item into the current document. Click the hyperlink in the document to jump to the item that the hyperlink points to.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151354				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX14\"\>Increases the outline level of the selected heading, and the headings that occur below the heading, by one. To only increase the outline level of the selected heading, hold down Ctrl, and then click this icon.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153011	14			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click here to set a reminder at the current cursor position. You can define up to five reminders. To jump to a reminder, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>\<emph\>Navigation\</emph\>\</link\> icon, in the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> window click the \<emph\>Reminder\</emph\> icon, and then click the \<emph\>Previous\</emph\> or \<emph\>Next\</emph\> button.\</ahelp\>Click here to set a reminder at the current cursor position. You can define up to five reminders. To jump to a reminder, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, in the Navigation window click the Reminder icon, and then click the Previous or Next button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153054				0	br	Set Reminder				2002-02-02 02:02:02
