helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10795				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the cursor to the next object of the selected type.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
