helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852	57			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens the Edit Paths dialog, where you can select the directory to store AutoText.\</ahelp\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010301.xhp\" name=\"Edit Paths\"\>Edit Paths\</link\> dialog, where you can select the directory to store AutoText.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
