helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154933	42			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_BIB_BASE:PB_NEW\"\>Creates a new AutoText category using the name that you entered in the\<emph\> Name\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_BIB_BASE_LB_PATH\"\>Displays the current path to the directory where the selected AutoText category files are stored. If you are creating an AutoText category, select where you want to store the category files.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155358				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_EDIT\"\>Opens the selected AutoText entry for editing in a separate document. Make the changes that you want, choose \<emph\>File - Save AutoText\</emph\>, and then choose \<emph\>File - Close\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155396	46			0	br	Use this area to set the way $[officename] inserts links to the AutoText directory. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
