helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156055				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_GLOSSARY:PB_BIB\"\>Adds, renames, or deletes AutoText categories.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
