helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149849				0	br	To change the format of a footnote or endnote anchor or text, select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>. You can press F11 to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window and modify the footnote or endnote paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
