helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149170				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_MULTMRK:LB_TOX\"\>Changes the outline level of a table of contents entry.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149486				0	br	Edits the selected index entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149823	8			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_MULTMRK:LB_TOX\"\>Edit the index entry if necessary. When you modify the index entry, the new text only appears in the index, and not at the index entry anchor in the document. \</ahelp\> For example, you can enter an index with comments such as "Basics, see also General".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_NEXT_SAME\"\>Jumps to the last index entry of the same type in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149965				0	br	Right Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150550				0	br	End arrow to left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150677				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3154020\" src=\"sd/res/imagelst/nv05.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154020\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151251				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_MULTMRK:LB_TOX\"\>Displays the type of index that the selected entry belongs to.\</ahelp\> You cannot change the index type of an index entry in this dialog. Instead, you must delete the index entry from the document, and then insert it again in a different index type.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151314				0	br	\<variable id=\"verzeichniseintragtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:IndexEntryDialog\"\>Edits the selected index entry. Click in front of or in the index entry, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153129				0	br	Left Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153298				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3153309\" src=\"sd/res/imagelst/nv06.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153309\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_MULTMRK:LB_TOX\"\>To create a multilevel index, type the name of the first level index entry, or select a name from the list. The current index entry is added below this name.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154327				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PREV\"\>Jumps to the previous index entry of the same type in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154633				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_NEXT\"\>Jumps to the next index entry of the same type in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155539				0	br	You can jump quickly to index entries with the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation Bar\"\>Navigation Bar\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155869				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PREV_SAME\"\>Jumps to the first index entry of the same type in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	br	To insert an index entry, select a word in the document, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Indexes and Tables - Entry\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155919				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_DELETE\"\>Deletes the selected entry from the index. The entry text in the document is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156108				0	br	End arrow to right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Edit Index Entry				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149820				0	br	Section				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153638				0	br	Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153673				0	br	Edit Sections				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155143				0	br	Undo				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143275				0	br	The \<emph\>Edit Sections\</emph\> dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, and offers the following additional options:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_DISMISS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Removes the selected section from the document, and inserts the contents of the section into the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	br	The current write protection status of a section is indicated by the lock symbol in front of the section name in the list. An open lock is unprotected and a closed lock is protected. Similarly, visible sections are indicated by a glasses symbol.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149104	5			0	br	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Type the name of the section that you want to edit, or click a name in the \<emph\>Section \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\> If the cursor is currently in a section, the section name is displayed on the right side of the status bar at the bottom of the document window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	br	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040501.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, where you can edit the column layout, background, footnote and endnote behavior of the selected section.\</ahelp\> If the section is password protected, you must enter the password first.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	br	\<variable id=\"bereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditRegion\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Changes the properties of sections defined in your document.\</ahelp\> To insert a section, select text or click in your document, and then choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Edit Sections				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149287				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Ruler\"\>Ruler\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ruler\"\>Shows or hides the horizontal ruler, that you can use to adjust page margins, tab stops, indents, borders, table cells, and to arrange objects on the page.\</ahelp\> To show the vertical ruler, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - View\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>\</link\>, and then select the \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	br	\<embedvar href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp#ruler\"/\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Ruler				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145418				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03070000.xhp\" name=\"Text Boundaries\"\>Text Boundaries\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151310				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ViewBounds\"\>Shows or hides the boundaries of the printable area of a page. The boundary lines are not printed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Text Boundaries				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151177				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03080000.xhp\" name=\"Field Shadings\"\>Field Shadings\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147513				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Marks\"\>Shows or hides field shadings in your document, including non-breaking spaces, custom hyphens, indexes, and footnotes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153540				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"Nonprinting Characters On/Off\"\>Nonprinting Characters On/Off\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Field Shadings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154505				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>Field Names\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145579				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Fields\"\>Insert - Fields\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147171				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Fieldnames\"\>Switches the field display between field names and field contents.\</ahelp\> A check mark indicates that the field names are displayed, and no check mark indicates that field contents are displayed. Some field contents cannot be displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287	4			0	br	To change the default field display to field names instead of the field contents, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>, and then select the\<emph\> Field codes \</emph\>checkbox in the \<emph\>Display\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098				0	br	When you print a document with \<emph\>View - Field Names\</emph\> enabled, you are prompted to include the field names in the print out.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154507				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"Nonprinting Characters\"\>Nonprinting Characters\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145410				0	br	When you delete a paragraph mark, the paragraph that is merged takes on the formatting of the paragraph that the cursor is in.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	br	To specify which nonprinting characters are displayed, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\>, and then select the options that you want in the \<emph\>Display of \</emph\>area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154646				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ControlCodes\"\>Shows nonprinting characters in your text, such as paragraph marks, line breaks, tab stops, and spaces.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Nonprinting Characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145243				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03120000.xhp\" name=\"Web Layout\"\>Web Layout\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154646				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BrowseView\"\>Displays the document as seen in a Web browser.\</ahelp\> This is useful when you create HTML documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03120000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Web Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150018				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03130000.xhp\" name=\"Print Layout\"\>Print Layout\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintLayout\"\>Displays how the document will look when you print it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Print Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155959				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03140000.xhp\" name=\"Hidden Paragraphs\"\>Hidden Paragraphs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	br	When you hide a paragraph, footnotes and frames that are anchored to characters in the paragraph are also hidden.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150251				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowHiddenParagraphs\"\>Shows or hides hidden paragraphs.\</ahelp\> This option only affects the screen display of hidden paragraphs, and not the printing of hidden paragraphs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	br	Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"field command\"\>field command\</link\> "Hidden Paragraph" to assign a \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\> that must be met to hide a paragraph. If the condition is not met, the paragraph is displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157875				0	br	To enable this feature, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\>, and ensure that the \<emph\>Hidden paragraphs\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Display of\</emph\> area is selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Hidden Paragraphs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145782				0	br	Change page number				2002-02-02 02:02:02
