helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"fussnoteein\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFootnote\"\>Inserts a footnote or an endnote in the document. The anchor for the note is inserted at the current cursor position.\</ahelp\> You can choose between automatic numbering or a custom symbol.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148981				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_INS_FOOTNOTE:RB_TYPE_FTN\"\>Inserts a footnote anchor at the current cursor position in the document, and adds a footnote to the bottom of the page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149812				0	br	Select the type of numbering that you want to use for footnotes and endnotes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175	24			0	br	\<variable id=\"endnotetext\"\>Footnotes are inserted at the end of a page, and endnotes are inserted at the end of a document.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151256				0	br	Select whether to insert a footnote or an endnote. Endnote numbering is separate from the footnote numbering.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152770				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_INS_FOOTNOTE:RB_TYPE_ENDNOTE\"\>Inserts an endnote anchor at the current cursor position in the document, and adds an endnote at the end of the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153526				0	br	\<variable id=\"bearbeitensonderzeichen\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_INS_FOOTNOTE:BT_NUMBER_CHAR\"\>Inserts a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04100000.xhp\" name=\"special character \"\>special character \</link\> as a footnote or endnote anchor.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153670	17			0	br	\<variable id=\"bearbeitenautomatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_INS_FOOTNOTE:RB_NUMBER_AUTO\"\>Automatically assigns consecutive numbers to the footnotes or endnotes that you insert.\</ahelp\> To change the settings for automatic numbering, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Footnotes\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Footnotes\</emph\>\</link\>.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154645	23			0	br	\<variable id=\"endnoten\"\>The following applies to both footnotes and endnotes.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155135				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footnote_usage.xhp\" name=\"Tips for working with footnotes\"\>Tips for working with footnotes\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155901	18			0	br	\<variable id=\"bearbeitenzeichen\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_INS_FOOTNOTE:ED_NUMBER_CHAR\"\>Choose this option to define a character or symbol for the current footnote.\</ahelp\> This can be either a letter or number. To assign a special character, click the button at the bottom.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Insert Footnote				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147506				0	br	 Insert Bookmark				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149817				0	br	Delete				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154188				0	br	Bookmarks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483				0	br	You cannot use the following characters in a bookmark name: / \\ @ : * ? " ; , . #				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"textmarkeein\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertBookmark\"\>Inserts a bookmark at the cursor position. You can then use the Navigator to quickly jump to the marked location at a later time.\</ahelp\> In an HTML document, bookmarks are converted to anchors that you can jump to from a hyperlink.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151251				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_INSERT_BOOKMARK:BT_DELETE\"\>To delete a bookmark, select the bookmark from the \<emph\>Insert Bookmark\</emph\> dialog and click the \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> button. No confirmation dialog will follow.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308				0	br	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>You can also right-click the \<emph\>Page Number\</emph\> field at the left end of the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\> at the bottom of the document window, and then choose the bookmark that you want to jump to.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677	3			0	br	To jump to a specific bookmark, press F5 to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>, click the plus sign (+) next to the\<emph\> Bookmark\</emph\> entry, and then double-click the bookmark.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:COMBOBOX:DLG_INSERT_BOOKMARK:CB_BOOKMARK\"\>Type the name of the bookmark that you want to create. The lower list contains all of the bookmarks in the current document. To delete a bookmark, select it in the list, and then click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Insert Bookmark				2002-02-02 02:02:02
