helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145245				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04070000.xhp\" name=\"Envelope\"\>Envelope\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
