helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_ENV_FMT_BOX_SIZE_FORMAT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Select the envelope size that want, or select "User Defined", and then enter the width and the height of the custom size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149041				0	br	Sets the position of the sender's address on the envelope.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149107				0	br	Sets the position and the text formatting options of the sender field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_ENV_FMT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the layout and the dimension of the envelope.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	br	Opens a dialog where you can edit the character formatting that is used in the addressee field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149551				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_METRICFIELD_TP_ENV_FMT_FLD_SIZE_WIDTH\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the width of the envelope.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828				0	br	Opens a dialog where you can edit the paragraph formatting that is used in the addressee field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
