helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150561				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_METRICFIELD_TP_ENV_FMT_FLD_SIZE_HEIGHT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the height of the envelope.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
