helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152957				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_ENV_FMT:FLD_ADDR_LEFT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the amount of space that you want to leave between the left edge of the envelope and the addressee field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	br	Sets the position and the text formatting options of the addressee field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154201				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:MENUBUTTON:TP_ENV_FMT:BTN_ADDR_EDIT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Click and choose the text formatting style for the addressee field that you want to edit.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154563				0	br	Sets the position of the recipient's address on the envelope.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
