helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_ENV_FMT:FLD_ADDR_TOP\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the amount of space that you want to leave between the top edge of the envelope and the addressee field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
