helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	br	When you refer to a database field in a condition, use the form Databasename.Tablename.Fieldname. If one of the names contains a character that is an operator, such as a minus sign (-), enclose the name in square brackets, for example, Databasename.[Table-name].Fieldname. Never use spaces inside field names.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
