helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120213.xhp	0	help	par_id3155863				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_TOX_SELECT:RB_FROMOBJECTNAMES\"\>Creates index entries from object names.\</ahelp\> You can view object names in the Navigator, for example, and change them in the context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
