helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3149109				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:LB_MAIN_ENTRY_STYLE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specify the formatting style for the main entries in the alphabetical index. To convert an index entry into a main entry, click in front of the index field in the document and then choose \<emph\>Edit - \</emph\>\<emph/\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Index Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.\</ahelp\> 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3153532				0	br	Level "S" refers to the single letter headings that divide the index entries alphabetically. To enable these headings, select the \<emph\>Alphabetical delimiter\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_COMMASEPARATED\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Arranges the index entries on the same line, separated by commas.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
