helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3147175				0	br	Lists the available bibliography entries. To add an entry to the \<emph\>Structure line\</emph\>, click the entry, click in an empty box on the \<emph\>Structure line\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:LB_AUTHFIELD\"\> Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120229.xhp\" name=\"Define Bibliography Entry\"\>Define Bibliography Entry\</link\> dialog to add new entries.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3149041				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:IMAGERADIOBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:RB_SORTDOWN3\"\>Sorts the bibliography entries in a descending alphanumerical order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3149491				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:LB_THIRDKEY\"\>Select the entry by which to sort the bibliography entries. This option is only available if you select the \<emph\>Content\</emph\> radio button in the \<emph\>Sort by\</emph\> area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3149687				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:RB_SORTCONTENT\"\>Sorts the bibliography entries by the \<emph\>Sort keys\</emph\> that you specify, for example, by author or by year of publication.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3149807				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_AUTHREMOVE\"\>Removes the selected reference code from the \<emph\>Structure line\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
