helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3151178				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_AUTHINSERT\"\>Adds the reference code for the selected bibliography entry to the \<emph\>Structure line\</emph\>. Select an entry in the list, click in an empty box, and then click this button.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
