helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420	21			0	br	In the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>box, select "Alphabetical Index".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3147220				0	br	To enable the "Match case" or "Word only" options, click in the corresponding cell, and then select the check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3149172				0	br	Search term;Alternative entry;1st key;2nd key;Match case;Word only				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables - Index/Table\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
