helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3151180				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_CREATE_AUTOMARK\"\>Create or edit a list of words to include in an Alphabetical Index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
