helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151189				0	br	Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	br	\<variable id=\"rahm\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFrame\"\>Inserts a frame that you can use to create a layout of one or more columns of text and objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148970				0	br	\<variable id=\"syrahmentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFrameInteract\"\>Draws a frame where you drag in the document. Click the arrow next to the icon to select the number of columns for the frame.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149694				0	br	You can also preview the effects when you change the frame anchor to "As Character". The "Baseline" is drawn in red, "Character" is the font height, and "line" is the height of the line, including the frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151311				0	br	If you see small red arrows at the beginning and the end of text in frame, use the arrow keys to scroll through the remaining text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	br	To delete a frame, click the border of the frame, and then press Delete.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	br	To edit a frame, click the border to select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Frame\</emph\>. You can also resize or move a selected frame using special \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04130100.xhp\" name=\"shortcut keys\"\>shortcut keys\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	br	In the preview area of the \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> dialog, the frame is represented by a green rectangle, and the reference area by a red rectangle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154506				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>moving;objects and frames\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects;moving/resizing using keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resizing;objects and frames, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	br	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145248				0	br	You can resize and move selected frames and objects with the keyboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	br	To move a selected frame or object, press an arrow key. To move by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	br	The increment by which you move an object with the keyboard is determined by the document grid. To change the properties of the document grid, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01050100.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text document - Grid\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150762				0	br	To resize a selected frame or object, first press Ctrl+Tab. Now one of the handles blinks to show that it is selected. TO select another handle, press Ctrl+Tab again. Press an arrow key to resize the object by one grid unit. To resize by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
