helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148970				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:CB_BORDER\"\>Adds a border to the table cells.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149036				0	br	\<variable id=\"autoformattext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:BT_AUTOFORMAT\"\>Opens the \<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\> dialog, where you can select a predefined layout for table.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149106				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:CB_DONT_SPLIT\"\>Prevents the table from spanning more than one page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149355				0	br	\<variable id=\"tabelletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTable\"\>Inserts a table into the document. You can also click the arrow, drag to select the number of rows and columns to include in the table, and then click in the last cell.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149694				0	br	Set the options for the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150688				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Table\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151181				0	br	To convert text into a table, select the text, and then choose \<emph\>Table - Convert - Text to Table\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151252				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:CB_REPEAT_HEADER\"\>Repeats the heading of the table at the top of subsequent page if the table spans more than one page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153511				0	br	On the Insert toolbar, click the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon to open the \<emph\>Insert Table\</emph\> dialog, where you can insert a table in the current document. You can also click the arrow, drag to select the number of rows and columns to include in the table, and then click in the last cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153533				0	br	Specify the number of columns and rows in the new table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153922				0	br	To insert a table from another document, copy the table, and then paste the table into the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154099				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:ED_NAME\"\>Enter a name for the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:ED_ROW\"\>Enter the number of rows that you want in the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154576				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:ED_COL\"\>Enter the number of columns that you want in the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	50			0	br	$[officename] can automatically format numbers that you enter in a table cell, for example, dates and times. To activate this feature, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</emph\> and click the\<emph\> Number recognition \</emph\>check box in the \<emph\>Input in tables\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155188				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:CB_HEADER\"\>Includes a heading row in the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155912				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Table - Text Flow\"\>Table - Table Properties - Text Flow\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10642				0	br	To insert a table into a table, click in a cell in the table and choose \<emph\>Table - Insert - Table\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10754				0	br	The first ... rows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04150000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10758				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"sw:NumericField:DLG_INSERT_TABLE:NF_REPEAT_HEADER\"\>Select the number of rows that you want to use for the heading.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
