helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149130				0	br	Exchanging Databases				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149349				0	br	Define				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	br	To exchange a database:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145827	11			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Replaces the current data source with the data source that you selected in the \<emph\>Available Databases \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147169				0	br	In the \<emph\>Available Databases\</emph\> list, select the replacement database table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	br	Click in the document that you want to change the data source for.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149053				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are currently in use.\</ahelp\> The current document contains at least one data field from each of the databases in the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149881				0	br	Ensure that both databases contain matching field names and field types.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150533				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are registered in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Exchange Database\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151273				0	br	Click \<emph\>Define\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	br	For example, if you inserting address fields in a form letter from an address database, you can then exchange the database with another address database to insert different addresses.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153925				0	br	In the \<emph\>Databases in Use\</emph\> list, select the database table that you want to replace.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	br	You can only change one database at a time in this dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	2			0	br	\<variable id=\"datenbankaustext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChangeDatabaseField\"\>Change the data sources for the current document.\</ahelp\> To correctly display the contents of inserted fields, the replacement database must contain identical field names. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DB				0	br	Browse				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DF				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"1419596301\"\>Opens a file open dialog to select a database file (*.odb). The selected file is added to the Available Databases list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Exchange Database				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04190000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147562				0	br	Insert (File)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04190000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145411				0	br	\<variable id=\"datei\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertDoc\"\>Inserts a text file at the current cursor position.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04190000.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BD				0	br	To always have the latest version of the contents of a file, insert a section into your document, and then insert a link to the text file in the section. See \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\"\>insert a section\</link\> for details.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
