helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143272				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_JAVAEDIT:RB_EDIT\"\>Enter the script code that you want to insert.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_JAVAEDIT:ED_TYPE\"\>Enter the type of script that you want to insert.\</ahelp\> The script is identified in the HTML source code by the tag <SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810	14			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_JAVAEDIT:ED_URL\"\>Adds a link to a script file. Click the \<emph\>URL \</emph\>radio button, and then enter the link in the box. You can also click the browse button (\<emph\>...\</emph\>), locate the file, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The linked script file is identified in the HTML source code by the following tags:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149880				0	br	An inserted script is indicated by a small green rectangle. If you do not see the rectangle, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - HTML Document\</emph\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"View\"\>\<emph\>View\</emph\>\</link\>, and select the \<emph\>Notes \</emph\>check box. To edit a script, double-click the green rectangle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150572				0	br	If your document contains more than one script, the \<emph\>Edit Script\</emph\> dialog contains previous and next buttons to jump from script to script.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151184	6			0	br	To specify if the script is printed at the end of the page or at the end of the document, choose \<emph\>File - Print - Options\</emph\>, and select the appropriate check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152963				0	br	<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript" SRC="url">				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	br	/* ignore all text here */				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_JAVAEDIT:PB_URL\"\>Locate the script file that you want to link to, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154574				0	br	</SCRIPT>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	br	\<variable id=\"scripttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertScript\"\>Inserts a script at the current cursor position in an HTML or text document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
