helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id2326425				0	br	The headers are visible only when you view the document in print layout (enable \<emph\>View - Print Layout\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145827				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageHeader\"\>Adds or removes a header from the page style that you select in the submenu. The header is added to all of the pages that use the same page style.\</ahelp\> In a new document, only the "Default" page style is listed. Other page styles are added to the list after you apply them in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150570				0	br	A check mark is displayed in front of the page styles that have headers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150761				0	br	To add or remove headers from all of the page styles that are in use in the document, choose \<emph\>Insert - Header - All\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153921				0	br	To remove a header, choose \<emph\>Insert - Header\</emph\>, and then select the page style containing the header. The header is removed from all of the pages that use this page style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	br	To format a header, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05040300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Page - Header\"\>\<emph\>Format - Page - Header\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
