helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04990000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145827				0	br	Inserts a field at the current cursor position. The submenu lists the most common field types. To view all of the available fields, choose \<emph\>Other\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
