helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149106				0	br	This section only appears when you edit the properties of the current paragraph by choosing \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:TP_NUMPARA:CB_RESTART_PARACOUNT\"\>Restarts the line numbering at the current paragraph, or at the number that you enter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149355				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_NUMPARA:NF_RESTART_PARA\"\>Enter the number at which to restart the line numbering\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	br	Specify the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06180000.xhp\" name=\"Line numbering\"\>Line numbering\</link\> options. To add line numbers to your document, choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536	14			0	br	To change the numbering options for paragraphs that use the same paragraph style, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles \</emph\>icon. Right-click the style in the list, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline/Numbering\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_NUMPARA:NF_NEW_START\"\>Enter the number that you want to assign to the paragraph.\</ahelp\> The following paragraphs are numbered consecutively from the number that you enter here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154100				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NUMPARA\"\>Adds or removes numbering or bullets from the paragraph. You can also select the style of numbering to use, and reset the numbering in a numbered list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470	26			0	br	To change the numbering options for selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline/Numbering\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154831				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:TP_NUMPARA:CB_NEW_START\"\>Restarts the numbering at the current paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_NUMPARA:LB_NUMBER_STYLE\"\>Select the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130004.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Style\"\>Numbering Style\</link\> that you want to apply to the paragraph.\</ahelp\> These styles are also listed in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window if you click the \<emph\>Numbering Style\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
