helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145206				0	br	Displays the column number, as well as width and distance to the adjacent columns.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147176				0	br	If the \<emph\>Automatic width\</emph\> check box is selected, enter the width and spacing options for the columns.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149024				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Evenly distributes the text in multi-column sections.\</ahelp\>Evenly distributes the text in \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020000.xhp\" name=\"multi-column sections\"\>multi-column sections\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3149750\" src=\"res/sc06301.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149750\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149309				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_METRICFIELD_TP_COLUMN_ED_HEIGHT\"\>Enter the length of the separator line as a percentage of the height of the column area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149352				0	br	You can select from predefined column layouts, or create your own. When you apply a layout to a page style, all pages that use the style are updated. Similarly, when you apply a column layout to a frame style, all frames that use that style are updated. You can also change the column layout for a single frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_COLUMN_LB_POSITION\"\>Select the vertical alignment of the separator line. This option is only available if \<emph\>Height\</emph\> value of the line is less than 100%.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149884				0	br	You can also select one of the predefined column layouts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150761				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_TP_COLUMN_BTN_DOWN\"\>Moves the column display one column to the left.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150986				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_COLUMN_CB_AUTO_WIDTH\"\>Creates columns of equal width.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	br	\<variable id=\"spaltentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_COLUMN\"\>Specifies the number of columns and the column layout for a page style, frame, or section.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
