helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152963				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_METRICFIELD_TP_COLUMN_ED_3\"\>Enter the width of the column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
