helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153576				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_TP_COLUMN_BTN_UP\"\>Moves the column display one column to the right.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
