helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	br	This area is only available if your layout contains more than one column.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154508				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_NUMERICFIELD_TP_COLUMN_ED_NUMBER\"\>Enter the number of columns that you want in the page, frame, or section.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
