helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154827				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_COLUMN_LB_APPLY_TO\"\>Select the item that you want to apply the column layout to.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if you access this dialog by choosing \<emph\>Format - Columns\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	br	The column layout preview only shows the columns and not the surrounding page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
