helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	br	Specify the column width properties.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149494				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:IMAGEBUTTON:TP_TABLE_COLUMN:COL_BTN_DOWN\"\>Displays the table columns found to the left of the current column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150976				0	br	Specify the column widths for the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530	6			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TABLE_COLUMN:CB_PROP\"\>Resizes the table width in relation to the column width that you enter.\</ahelp\> This option is not available if \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> is selected in the \<emph\>Alignment \</emph\>area on the \<emph\>Table \</emph\>tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154280	4			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TABLE_COLUMN:CB_MOD_TBL\"\>Maintains the current width of the table when you change the width of a column.\</ahelp\> This option is not available if \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> is selected in the \<emph\>Alignment \</emph\>area on the \<emph\>Table \</emph\>tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154571	8			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_TABLE_COLUMN:ED_SPACE\"\>Displays the amount of space that is available for adjusting the width of the columns. To set the width of the table, click the \<emph\>Table \</emph\>tab.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159193				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_TABLE_COLUMN:COL_MF_6\"\>Enter the width that you want for the column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
