helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154506				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>tables; editing with the keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150564				0	br	Resizing Columns and Rows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	br	Inserting and deleting columns or rows				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	br	\<variable id=\"tabelle_tastatur\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090201.xhp\" name=\"Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\"\>Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145244				0	br	You can resize and delete table columns with the keyboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	br	To insert a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down Alt and press Insert, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147566				0	br	To increase the left indent of the table, hold down Alt+Shift, and then press the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149286				0	br	To move the table downwards on the page, hold down Alt+Shift, and then press the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150759				0	br	To resize a row, place the cursor in the row, hold down Alt, and then press the up or the down arrows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150983				0	br	To change the behavior of tables in a text document, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text Document - Table\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	br	To delete a column, place the cursor in the column that you want to delete, hold down Alt and press Delete, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153531				0	br	To delete a row, place the cursor in the row that you want to delete, hold down Alt and press Delete, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153920				0	br	To resize a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down Alt, and then press the left or the right arrow. To resize the column without changing the width of the table, hold down Alt+Ctrl, and then press the left or the right arrows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	br	To insert a row, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down Alt and press Insert, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
