helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308				0	br	Frame Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152769				0	br	Displays styles appropriate to the current context.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	br	Page Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153154				0	br	Description				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	br	Displays all styles of the active style category.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153642				0	br	Automatic				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153721				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:RID_STYLECATALOG:BT_TOOL\"\>These are the different categories of formatting styles.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196	63			0	br	Numbering Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154374				0	br	All Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154774				0	br	Displays the user-defined conditional styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154828				0	br	These are the style groups that you can display in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155560				0	br	Conditional Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897				0	br	Use Page Styles to organize the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155908				0	br	Character Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155975				0	br	Displays formatting styles for indexes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156368				0	br	Custom Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Styles in Writer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148489				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130002.xhp\" name=\"Character Style\"\>Character Style\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154650				0	br	Here, you can create a font style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Character Style 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155961				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130004.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Style\"\>Numbering Style\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149501				0	br	Here you can create a Numbering Style. The Numbering Styles are organized in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130004.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	br	When a Numbering Style is created, a name is assigned to the numbering. This is why such templates are also called "named" numberings. Unnamed numberings, which are used for \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"direct formatting\"\>direct formatting\</link\>, can be created in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06050000.xhp\" name=\"Numbering/bullets\"\>Bullets and Numbering\</link\> dialog or with the icons of the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"object bar\"\>object bar\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130004.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Numbering Style 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154656				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>styles; conditional\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>conditional styles\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149306				0	br	Remove				2002-02-02 02:02:02
