helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155576				0	br	Applied Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143282				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FrameStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for frames.\</ahelp\> Use frame styles to format frame layouts and position.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
