helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147220				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PageStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for pages.\</ahelp\> Use page styles to determine page layouts, including the presence of headers and footers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
