helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148391				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Use the Styles and Formatting window to apply, create, edit, add, and remove formatting styles. Double-click an entry to apply the style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148860				0	br	The commands offered in the Styles and Formatting window are the same as those found in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130000.xhp\" name=\"Style Catalog\"\>\<emph\>Style Catalog\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148976				0	br	Page Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149552				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a new style based on the formatting of the current paragraph, page, or selection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149800				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ParaStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for paragraphs.\</ahelp\> Use paragraph styles to apply the same \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"formatting\"\>formatting\</link\>, such as font, numbering, and layout to the paragraphs in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
