helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CharStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for characters.\</ahelp\> Use character styles to apply font styles to selected text in a paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154643				0	br	The Styles and Formatting toolbar contains icons for formatting your documents:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156379				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TEMPLDLG_WATERCAN\"\>Applies the selected style to the object or text that you select in the document. Click this icon, and then drag a selection in the document to apply the style.\</ahelp\> To exit this mode, click the icon again, or press Esc.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3159200\" src=\"sw/imglst/sf03.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159200\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	br	To \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> the Styles and Formatting window, drag its title bar to the left or to the right side of the workspace. To undock the window, double-click a free space on its toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	br	You can assign shortcut keys to Styles on the \<emph\>Tools - Customize - Keyboard\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
