helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017	2			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OnlineAutoFormat\"\>Automatically formats the document while you type. To set the formatting options, choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>tab.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
