helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06040000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10552				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"FN_WORDCOUNT_DIALOG\"\>Counts the words and characters in the current selection and in the whole document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
