helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149499				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UpdateCurIndex\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Updates the current index.\</ahelp\> The current index is the one that contains the cursor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditCurIndex\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Edits the current index or table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154763				0	br	You can also right-click in an index or table of contents, and then choose \<emph\>Update Index/Table\</emph\>. The following commands are also available in the context menu:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RemoveTableOf\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Deletes the current index or table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
