helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3150508\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_defaultnumbering.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150508\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150952				0	br	Some of the bullets and numbering options are not available when working in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03120000.xhp\" name=\"Web Layout\"\>Web Layout\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\02110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Numbering on/off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
