helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146899				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoSum\"\>Activates the sum function. Note that the cursor must be in the cell where you want the sum to appear.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	br	Click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\> to accept the sum formula as it appears in the entry line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
