helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145410				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3145421\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_incrementsublevels.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145421\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145417				0	br	Move Up with Subpoints				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151189				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:IncrementSubLevels\"\>Shifts paragraphs with subpoints up one numbering level.\</ahelp\> This is only visible when the cursor is positioned within numbered or bulleted text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
