helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147410				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:MF_LMARGIN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the left margin width.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
