helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148775				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PreviewPrintOptions\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Opens a dialog where settings for the printout of your document can be made.\</ahelp\> The pages are proportionally reduced in size. When printing multiple document pages on one printed page, the whole sheet of paper may not be printed on and a margin may remain.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148857				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:MF_BMARGIN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the bottom margin height.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149099				0	br	Print options page view				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149579				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:PB_STANDARD\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies that the system will not use a fixed number of rows and columns when printing out the page view, but rather uses what was originally shown in the page view.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:MF_VMARGIN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Determines the vertical distance between document pages.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149969				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:RB_LANDSCAPE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Prints the page in landscape format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150100				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:MF_HMARGIN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Determines the horizontal distance between document pages.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150546				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:MF_TMARGIN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the top margin height.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153634				0	br	Determines the number of rows and columns to print, as well as the print size. You can also choose to print several document pages on one printed page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154031				0	br	Determines what print format to use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154567				0	br	The settings entered on the \<emph\>Print options\</emph\> dialog will only be activated if you print out the document using the \<emph\>Print page view\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155141				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:NF_ROWS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Defines the number of rows of pages (horizontally stacked document pages).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	br	The print margins can be determined in this area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155916				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:NF_COLS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Defines the number of pages shown in columns (vertically tiled document pages).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156097				0	br	The spacing section is used to determine the horizontal and vertical distances between the reduced document pages on one page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
