helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148566				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Other\"\>Other\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153916				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Fields\"\>Insert Fields\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403	2			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to open the Fields dialog. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a submenu.\</ahelp\>Click to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\"\>Fields\</link\> dialog. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154503				0	br	You can choose from the following functions:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Insert Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151175				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030100.xhp\" name=\"Date\"\>Date\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertDateField\"\>Inserts the current date as a field.\</ahelp\> The default date format is used, and the date is not automatically updated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	br	If you would like to define a different date format, or have the date updated automatically, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> to insert a field command and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The format of an existing date field can be modified at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Date				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147174				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>time fields;inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields;inserting time\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147174				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030200.xhp\" name=\"Time\"\>Time\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	br	To assign a different time format, or adapt the actual time data, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired changes in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. Additionally, you can modify the format of an inserted time field at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTimeField\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the current time as a field.\</ahelp\> The time is taken directly from the system settings of your operating system. A fixed time format is applied, which cannot be updated by using the F9 function key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Time				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147173				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030300.xhp\" name=\"Page Numbers\"\>Page Numbers\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150760				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageNumberField\"\>Inserts the current page number as a field at the cursor position.\</ahelp\> The default setting is the Page Style format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175				0	br	If you would like to define a different format or modify the page number, insert a field with \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. It is also possible to edit a field inserted with the \<emph\>Page Numbers\</emph\> command with \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Page Numbers				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145828				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030400.xhp\" name=\"Page Count\"\>Page Count\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageCountField\"\>Inserts as a field the total number of pages in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	br	If you wish to have the page number formatted with a different numbering style, choose \<emph\>Insert - Field - Other\</emph\> to insert the required field, and specify the settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Field\"\>\<emph\>Field\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The format of the field inserted using the \<emph\>Page Number\</emph\> command can also be modified using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Field\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Field\</emph\>\</link\> command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Page Count				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147169				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>subject fields\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields; subject\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147169				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030500.xhp\" name=\"Subject\"\>Subject\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152892				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTopicField\"\>Inserts the subject specified in the document properties as a field .\</ahelp\> This field displays the data entered in the \<emph\>Subject\</emph\> field under \<emph\>File - Properties - Description\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156380				0	br	If you would like to insert a different document property as a field, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>DocInformation\</emph\> category contains all of the fields shown in the document properties.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Subject				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154484				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030600.xhp\" name=\"Title\"\>Title\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	br	If you would like to insert a different document property as a field, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>DocInformation\</emph\> category contains all of the fields shown in the document properties.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTitleField\"\>Inserts the title specified in the document properties as a field.\</ahelp\> This field displays the data entered in the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> field under \<emph\>File - Properties - Description\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Title				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154505				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030700.xhp\" name=\"Author\"\>Author\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030700.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertAuthorField\"\>Inserts the name of the person who created the document here as a field.\</ahelp\> The field applies the entry made under \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - $[officename] - User data\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - User data\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030700.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Author				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147167				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>graphics;do not show\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>images;do not show\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures;do not show\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148568				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18120000.xhp\" name=\"Graphics On/Off\"\>Graphics On/Off\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167	3			0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Graphic\"\>If the\<emph\> Graphics On/Off \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Tools\</emph\> bar is activated, no graphics are displayed - only empty frames as placeholders.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3156379\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphic.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156379\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154107				0	br	Graphics On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Graphics On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147167				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>direct cursor; restriction\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147167				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18130000.xhp\" name=\"Direct Cursor On/Off\"\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147508				0	br	\<image id=\"img_id3154840\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shadowcursor.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154840\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148982				0	br	The direct cursor sets tabs to position the cursor. If you change the tabs later. the position of the text on the page may change as well.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255				0	br	The AutoCorrect tool automatically removes empty paragraphs, tabs, and spaces that are inserted by the direct cursor. If you want to use the direct cursor, then disable the AutoCorrect tool.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151310				0	br	Direct Cursor On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShadowCursor\"\>Activates or deactivates the direct cursor.\</ahelp\> You can specify the behavior of the direct cursor by choosing \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	br	The direct cursor allows you to click in any blank area of a page to place text, images, tables, frames, and other objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	br	If you place the direct cursor approximately in the middle between the left and the right margin of a page or a table cell, the text you insert will be centered. Similarly, text is right-aligned when the direct cursor is placed on the right margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Direct Cursor On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148769				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/19010000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Header\"\>Insert Header\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151180				0	br	\<ahelp hid=\"FN_INSERT_HEADER\"\>Displays the header of an HTML document if headers are enabled on the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05040300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Page - Header\"\>\<emph\>Format - Page - Header\</emph\>\</link\> tab page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Insert Header				2002-02-02 02:02:02
