helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147407				0	br	\<variable id=\"auto_numbering\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/auto_numbering.xhp\" name=\"Creating Numbered or Bulleted Lists as You Type\"\>Creating Numbered or Bulleted Lists as You Type\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
