helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autocorr_except.xhp	0	help	par_id3147786	19			0	br	Type the abbreviation followed by a period in the \<emph\>Abbreviations (no subsequent capital) \</emph\>box and click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autocorr_except.xhp	0	help	par_id3147812	20			0	br	Type the word in the \<emph\>Words with TWo INitial CApitals \</emph\>box and click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
