helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155090	43			0	br	To quickly enter a %PRODUCTNAME Math formula, type "FN", and then press F3. If you insert more than one formula, the formulae are sequentially numbered. To insert dummy text, type "DT", and then press F3. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Macros - Organize Macros - %PRODUCTNAME Basic\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155160				0	br	In the \<emph\>Macro from\</emph\> list, double-click "%PRODUCTNAME Macros - Gimmicks".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155560				0	br	Select the text, text with graphics, table, or field that you want to save as an AutoText entry. A graphic can only be stored if it is anchored as a character and is preceded and followed by at least one text character.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155581				0	br	Choose\<emph\> Edit - AutoText\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
