helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	br	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	br	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	br	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
