helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7093111				0	br	Repeatedly click an edge or a corner to switch through the three different states.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7253028				0	br	Click the left icon to clear all lines. This removes all outer borders and all inner lines.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7276833				0	br	Click the rightmost icon to set an outer border. The inner lines are not changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
