helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147682				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>outline numbering\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>removing;heading numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>chapter numbering\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>headings; numbering\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering;headings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>headings; own paragraph styles\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
