helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147758				0	br	Select the custom style in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147782	39			0	br	Click the heading level that you want to assign to the custom paragraph style in the\<emph\> Level\</emph\> list. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
