helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114				0	br	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3152777				0	br	Enable the check mark at \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902				0	br	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155845				0	br	\<bookmark_value\>hyperlinks; inserting from Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting; hyperlinks from Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cross-references; inserting with Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;hyperlinks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Navigator;inserting hyperlinks\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
