helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	hd_id129398				0	br	\<variable id=\"indenting\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indenting.xhp\"\>Indenting Paragraphs\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	br	Right-click a paragraph and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Paragraph Style - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for all paragraphs that have the same Paragraph Style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	br	The indents are different regarding the writing direction. For example, look at the "Before text" indent value in left-to-right languages. The left edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the left page margin. In right-to-left languages, the right edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the right page margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	br	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for the current paragraph or for all selected paragraphs. You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	br	For a hanging indent, enter a positive value for "Before text" and a negative value for "First line".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id5589159				0	br	To change the measurement units, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</item\>, and then select a new measurement unit in the Settings area. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7271645				0	br	Indents are calculated with respect to the left and right page margins. If you want the paragraph to extend into the page margin, enter a negative number. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7953123				0	br	You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>. To display the ruler, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Ruler\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id9936216				0	br	You can change the indents for the current paragraph, or for all selected paragraphs, or for a Paragraph Style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	tit				0	br	Indenting Paragraphs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
