helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3146897				0	br	In the \<emph\>Insert Bibliography Entry \</emph\>dialog, click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147059				0	br	Select the name of the bibliography entry that you want to insert in the \<emph\>Short name \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085				0	br	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	br	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<emph\>Short name \</emph\>box, and then add additional information to the record in the remaining boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3148402				0	br	Click in your document where you want to add the bibliography entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3148421				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219	66			0	br	Close the\<emph\> Bibliography Database\</emph\> window. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150525				0	br	Select \<emph\>From document content\</emph\> and click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150945				0	br	Click in your document where you want to add the bibliography entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	br	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153231				0	br	Select \<emph\>From bibliography database\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	br	$[officename] stores bibliographic information in a bibliography database, or in an individual document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153738				0	br	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<emph\>Short name \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153763				0	br	Select the publication source for the record in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>box, and then add additional information in the remaining boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	br	A bibliography is a list of works that you reference in a document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872				0	br	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02250000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Bibliography Database\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Bibliography Database\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155900				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Record\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	br	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Bibliography Database\"\>Bibliography Database\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
