helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2582476				0	br	Select any ruler type below of the "Plain" ruler type. This inserts a new paragraph at the position of the cursor. A picture showing a graphical horizontal line is inserted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
