helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\jump2statusbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178	31			0	br	To go to a specific bookmark in your document, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>hold down Ctrl and click \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>right-click\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> in the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> field on the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>, and then choose the bookmark.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
