helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145100				0	br	Press the down arrow key, and then press the right arrow key to set the width of the section that you want to insert.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149630				0	br	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Section\</emph\> icon is selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149685				0	br	Press the keys Alt+<underlined character> to open a menu. In an open menu, press the underlined character to run a command. For example, press Alt+I to open the \<emph\>Insert \</emph\>menu, and then T to insert a table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388				0	br	Press F6 until the focus is on the\<emph\> Standard\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154849				0	br	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon is selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155186				0	br	To open a context menu, press Shift+F10. To close a context menu, press Escape.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155870				0	br	Press F6 until the focus is on the\<emph\> Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872				0	br	Press the down arrow key, and then use the arrow keys to select the number of columns and rows to include in the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	br	Press Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156237				0	br	Press Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156253				0	br	Press F6 to place the cursor inside the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	br	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Insert\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072C				0	br	Press F6 to place the cursor inside the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
