helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145086				0	br	\<variable id=\"load_styles\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/load_styles.xhp\" name=\"Using Styles From Another Document or Template\"\>Using Styles From Another Document or Template\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	br	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	br	Use the check boxes at the bottom of the dialog to select the style types that you want to import. To replace styles in the current document that have the same name as the ones you are importing, select \<emph\>Overwrite\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153377				0	br	Click \<emph\>From File\</emph\>, locate the file containing the styles that you want to use, and then click name, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	br	You can import styles from another document or template into the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155910				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	br	Click an entry in the \<emph\>Categories \</emph\>list, then click the template containing the styles that you want to use in the \<emph\>Templates \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN10703				0	br	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon to open the submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070B				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Load styles\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
