helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	br	The \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>displays the different parts of your document, such as headings, tables, frames, objects, or hyperlinks.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154247				0	br	To open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, press F5.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155878				0	br	To quickly jump to a location in your document, double-click an item listed in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
