helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	br	Enter text in the frame and if you want, resize the frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150242				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Format - Frame\</emph\>, and then click the\<emph\> Options\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150320				0	br	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
