helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145411	14			0	br	Place the cursor in a cell in the column, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, and then press the left or the right arrow key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
