helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153130				0	br	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars- Drawing\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Drawing \</emph\>toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
