helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154415	71			0	br	Click outside of the object, then click the text you entered. Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/05090000.xhp\" name=\"Object Rotation Mode\"\>\<emph\>Rotate\</emph\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3145405\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145405\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Drawing Object Properties\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
