helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149646				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles \</emph\>icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149818				0	br	You can apply numbering to a paragraph manually or with a paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
