helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3145113				0	br	To look up the word in a different language, click \<emph\>Language \</emph\>in the\<emph\> Thesaurus\</emph\> dialog, select one of the installed languages, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. In the \<emph\>Thesaurus\</emph\> dialog, click \<emph\>Search\</emph\>. The thesaurus may not be available for all installed languages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	br	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149820				0	br	You can use the thesaurus to look up synonyms, and related words.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149848				0	br	In the \<emph\>Meaning \</emph\>list, select the definition that matches the context of the word.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3153136				0	br	Select the replacement word in the \<emph\>Synonym \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
