helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3155867				0	br	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Thesaurus\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F7.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
