helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10809				0	br	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040600.xhp\"\>Word Completion \</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B03				0	br	 Select \<emph\>Append space\</emph\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0E				0	br	 The space character is appended after you type the first character of the next word after the auto-completed word. The space character is suppressed if the next character is a delimiter, such as a full stop or a new line character. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B20				0	br	 Choose the key to accept the suggested word using the \<emph\>Accept with\</emph\> list box. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B36				0	br	 Use the \<emph\>Min. word length\</emph\> box to set the minimum number of characters a word must have to be collected into the list. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B4C				0	br	 Select \<emph\>When closing a document, save the list for later use in other documents\</emph\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B53				0	br	 Now the list is also valid for other documents that you open. When you close the last %PRODUCTNAME document, the word list is deleted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B56				0	br	 If you do not select the checkbox, the list is only valid as long as the current document is open. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B94				0	br	 If the automatic spellcheck option is enabled, only the words that are recognized by the spellcheck are collected. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
